<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz gamah Job kici mi khat a om hi. Tua mipa nuol baang lo, a thutang, Pasien a giing le sietna lam a pel mi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tapa sagi le tanu thum nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in tuu tulsagi, kalaoh tulthum, bawngtang kap zanga, laa pi zanga le nasem tampi nei hi; tuaci’n tam mipa pen nisuona gama mi zosie sungah a haupen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ tapate an kikumin inn khat pan inn khatah a ban banin pei kawikawi uhi; tuale amate in a nehpi a dawnpi dingun amau’ sanggam numei thum a ciel let uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pawi bawl uh viel khat a kihlit zaw ciengin Job in amate hlanin siensuo a, zingmawngin ama thobai-in a tapate zosie adingin a phaza tawh kizui-in meihal biehnate a pie hi; azieh pen Job in, “Ka tapate tawnkhielin a lungsim vuah Pasien na samsie kha thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni khat Topa mai-a kilah dingin van mite a pei vua, amate lahah Satan zong kihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Nang hei pana hing pei na hei?” a ci hi. Satan in Topa kungah, “Leitungah ka vah kawikawi a, tunglam le neilam ka kawmna pana ang pei ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Ka nasem Job na phawh kha ngai ei mah? Nuol a baang lo, a thutang, Pasien giingin sietna a pel ama tawh a kibang leitungah om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua bepin Satan in Topa dawng a, “Job in Pasien ang mawh giin ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama le a inn le a neisa zosie kimvelah dai kai hi lo na mah? Nang in a sepna zosie thupha na buoh a, gam sungah ama’ neisa a pung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in na khut zahin a neisa zosie lahpieh lacin na maitang mama-ah hing gausam pai ta va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Hoi pai e, a neisa zosie nangma’ thu hi taheh; a tung behah na khut hlang sih po lacin!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Topa kung panin Satan a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni khat a sanggam pasal a tapen pa uh’ inn ah a tapate le a tanute an ne-in zu dawnin a op laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kamtai khat tungin Job kungah, “Bawngtangte in lo kai-in tuate gei-ah laate a gamtat laitahin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sebea-te in ei simin tuate a kaimang ta vua, namsau tawh nasemte a that sieng ta uhi; nang kunga gen dinga kei beh ang suohta ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thugen a hlit masangin adang khat tung leuleu a, “Vantung panin Pasien’ meikuong khat ang kiesuh a, tuute le a nasemte a katum sieng ta hi; nang kunga gen dinga kei beh ang suohta ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thu gen a hlit masang ma-in adang khat tung leuleu a, “Chaldea-te pawl thum kisuo-in kalaohte ang bulu vua, a kaimang sieng ta uhi. Nasemte zong namsau tawh a that sieng ta uhi; nang kunga gen dinga kei beh ang suohta ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thu gen a hlit masangin adang khat tungkia a, “Na tapate le na tanute in a sanggam pasal tapen pa’ inn ah an ne zu dawnin a op laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thakhatthu-in senel gam panin huipi hat mama khat ang lang a, inn ningli teng semmangin, nungah tangvalte tungah kiesuh a, amate a si sieng uhi; nang kunga gen dinga kei beh ang suohta ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job dingin a puon balkeh a, a sam heukieu-in lei-ah bohsuhin Pasien a bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka nu sung pan guohtangin ka suoh a, guohtang ma-in ka kilekia ding hi; Topa in ei pie a, Topa ma in a kilahkia ta hi; Topa’ min phatin om taheh” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam thu zosie-ah Job maw loin Pasien zong mawsah lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Topa kungah van mite a kilah dingin a tung vua, Topa mai-a kilah dingin Satan zong amate lahah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Nang hei pana hing pei na hiei?” a ci hi. Satan in Topa kungah, “Leitungah ka vah kawikawi a, tunglam le neilam ka kawmna pana ang pei ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Ka nasem Job na phawh kha ngai ei mah? A nuol baang lo, a thutang, Pasien giingin sietna a pel ama tawh a kibang leitungah koima om lo hi,” a ci hi. A hang om lo pi-in ama suhsiet dinga kei nei hantawh vangin ama in a citahna a hlasuo nai deh sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Satan in Topa dawng a, “Vun tangin vun! Mite in amau’ hinna a hutdam nadingin a neisa zosie uh a pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in na khut zah inlen, a gu le a telte va khoipieh lacin na maitang mama-ah hing gausam pai ta va” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Satan kungah, “Hoi pai lien e, ama nangma thu thu ahi ta hi; a hinna khat beh khawipieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa kung panin Satan pusuoh a, Job a ketaw pan a luvum dongin a kidahhuoi hima a veisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Job in a kikhuot nading beelkeh khat la a, vut lahah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a zi in ama kungah, “Na citahna tudet tentun lai ding na mah? Pasien gausam inlen kisi ta ven,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a zi kungah, “Numei mawte kamham bangin na ham hi. Pasien kung panin a hoi sang hi vei, a sie zong i sang sih ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Job’ khanguol thum, Teman-te Eliphaz, Shuh mi Bildad, le Naamah mi Zophar-te in ama tunga a tung tam gimnate zosie a zah ciengun, a inn ciet panun ama hlai ding le henem dingin a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in a gamla panin ama a galmu ciengun a thei pah ta sih vua, tuale amate in a aw uh sangsahin a gingin a kap uhi; amate in a puon uh a botkeh vua, a lu tung vua tukia dingin van lamah leivui a septo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in sun sagi le zan sagi sung tuol puongah ama a topi vua, tuale koima in ama kam khat beh a hopi ngam sih uhi, azieh pen ama’ thuohna a natsiet lamtah amate in a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Job in a kam kah a, a pien ni a gausam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Job in gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka suo ni le ‘Nausen pasal khat gai hi,’ a kici zan mangthai taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni khu khimzin ni suoh taheh! Tung Pasien in tua khu sui da se hinlen, ahi sihle tua tungah khuovah zong tang da kon heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuoniim le mielkiing in lie taheh. Meiipi in a tungah tuom hinlen; sun mielking in zausah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khummi zan khu khuomiel sapi in mancip taheh! Kum khat sunga nidangte tawh kisimtha da hinlen; hla min kisimte lahah zong kihal da mai taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ou e, khum zanin nau pieng sih taheh; tua sungah nopna kikona aw kizah da kon heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leviathan a phin theite, mi samsie theite in tua Tuipi khu samsie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phalvah huna zingsol aasite miel taheh; tua in khuovah lamen hinlen, hinanle khat zong mukha sih heh; zingkal phalvah zong mu kha da taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen tua in ka nu sunga naubu kotte a na khah lo ziehin, ka muna panin lungkhamna a na phuolmang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Bang dingin a sisa-in na suoh kon lo a, bang dingin ka nu sunga ka suo behin na si pai lo ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang dingin ei tawi ding khup om a, ka tawp ding nawi na om kha kawi adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in ahile hanah lumin ka sip dide ta ding hi; ka kimu hit hiet ta ding a; tua ciengin ka tawlnga ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate dinga khuopi sie a lamkia leitunga kumpite le a thu kuppite tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahi sihle a inn uh kham le ngun tawh a kidim uliente tawh nuomtahin ka khawl ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi sihle bang dinga a hla cing lo-a suohte le, khuovah mu ngai nai lo-a a si nausen khat bangin, ei na kivui kha lo adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khumnah migilote in buoisah nawn loin, khumnah a basamte a tawlnga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khumnah thongkiete in nuom saton ding uhi. Amate in nasem uhpa’ husa a za kha nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khumnah a lien a neu omton valiei a, silate nasan a pupa kung pan suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bang dingin mi genthei pa khuovah kimusah a, hin genthei-a hing pa zong hinna kipie ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Si ding a ngahla vangut mite tungah sina a tung thei vawt sih a, a kiphuol gougil taw sangin kithuhtawzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in hankhuh a mu ciengun, kipahin a lungdam ngel sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lampi a mu vawt lo mipa, Pasien in dai a kaipieh mipa tungah bang dingin khuovah kipie ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen ka khuisahna ka an tawh kibang a, ka mauna khu tui kibua tawh a kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka giingiin thu ka tungah ang tung tahtah a, ka zauzau thu ka tungah ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungnuomin ka om sih a, sip dide-in zong ka om sih hi; tawlngah hun ka nei sih a; hinanle gimna ang tung hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Teman-te Eliphaz in tam bangin a dawng hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi khat in kam khat hing genpi leh na lungthah diei mah? Ahi vangin, koi ahei ham lo phun lo-a om ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />En vawi, nang in mi tampi na hil zo ta a, khutkham bankhamte zong na hatsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kammal in a kipalpuate phongto zo a, a khupzaw mite na ding detsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in na tungah tua khu ang tung ta a, nang in thuohha na sa hi; tuami in nang ang sukha a, nang na lung a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na Pasien giinna khu na muonna ahi a, na thumanna lampi na hlasuo lona khu na kinepna hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tu-in ngaisun vawi le, mawna nei lopi-in koi a kisusie ngai ta ahei? Ahi sihle a thutang mite hei-ah a mangthai ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lo bangin gitlona kai a, buoina a tu mipa in a gamtat bangin a ga a at lam keima in ka mu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien’ husan tawh amate a kisie vua, a lungthahna hui in amate a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Humpinelkai’ hawhna, a giinhuoi humpi awging a dai ta a, tuale humpi note’ hate zong tawng sieng zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sa mat ding a nei lo humpi khu a mangthai a, humpi note a kithezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tu-in kei kungah thu khat ang kidap gen a, ka bil in tua ang kidapgen thu a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan mang sungah lunggel zosie a kilah laitah, mite a ihsip laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka tungah zauna ang tung a, ka citunin ka gu ka tang zosie a kithingsah gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlagau khat in ka mai ang zapsuh a; ka cimul ang tho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khumi khu a ding den a, hizongle a mel puoh ka khen thei sih hi. Ka mithla-ah a guong khat ang kisung hi; a sip khian a, tua zaw-in awging khat ka za hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien mai-amihingte a thuman zo ding uh amah? A siem pa mai-ah mihingte a siengtho zo ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nasemte lah bawnah tahsanna nei loin a vantung mite mawsah lai ahile;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tungman inn sunga tengte, a inn khuombul lei lah ahi, nget banga kituoncilte khu bang a ci tahsan sih kan lai diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zingkal nitah kalin amate kisusie hi; koima’ khawhsah loin amate a si den ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sungah a puonbuh khau uh a kibot dawh a, tuale amate pilna tasamin a silaw ding uhi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tu-in hlan vawi ta, ang dawng ding koi a om ei? A siengtho koi pen kunga kinuahei sawm na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tahtahin mimawpa in a lungthahna silaw a, thangsietna in mimawlte sisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in mimawte zunghlah dan ka mu a, ahi vangin a tenna uh awsie ka law zuai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tate uh ahile bihna tawh a kigam la vua, khuopi tunkotah amate kituonciin, amate a hum ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A gilkiel mite in a anlahte uh a ne vua, amate in lingte lah pan nangawnin a la uhi; Tuale a dangtate in zong amau’ nei le lamte a lunggul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen lunggimna khu lei lah panin ang pei sih a, buoina zong khu tuolgum pana ang pei ahi kan sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahi vangin meisite a tung lamah a lento bang lienin, mihingte zong khu a gim dinga suoh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei ka hi leh Pasien ka sui ding a, Pasien tungah ka vaite ka ap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in na lienpite le sui zawh lo nate, sim zawh lo na lamdangte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in lei tungah guo zusah a, lolai-ah tui a luongsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in a nei lut mite domsang a, a kap a maute bihna ah a lamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khelpilte a lawcin lo nadingin, ama in a gelnate uh a suhsietpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in mipilte pen amau’ khelpilna ma tawh man a, ama in mi lungkawite’ ngimna zong a naw khawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in sun lai-in khuomiel a tuoh kha vua, zanlai bangin a kimaimaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle ama in a kam sung vua namsau pan le mi thahatte panin tasamte hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n mizawngte in kinepna a nei vua, thuman lo mite in a kam a hum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Pasien’ phawsiet mite khu mi nuomsa ahi uhi; tua ziehin Vanglienpa’ khalna khu thudon loin om sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in liemsah a, ahi vangin ama in a tunpieh vanuh hi. Ama in a vuo a, a khut in a damsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in buoina nam guh panin nangma ang hunkhie ding a, a sagi veina-ah sietna in ang sukha ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in kielpi sunga sina pan le galpi sunga namsau panin nangma ang tankhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gensietna panin ang kiphuol ding a, kisietna ang tun ciengin na zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang in suhsiet ding le kiel tun dingte na nuisan lel ding a, nangma in leitung gamsate na giing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen lo-a suongte tawh na kipawl ding a, gamsate tawh na kilem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma in na buh a muonhuoi lam na thei ding a, na tuubuh na van ciengin bangma pelem lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na suonlehlahte tampi pha-in, nangma sunga piengte zong leitung lopa za pha ding hi, ci thu nangma in na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hun ciengin ancilna phuolah bulom a tun ma bangin vuoisi-in han na zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En vawi, kote in tam teng ka na kantel vua, tua khu a thuman ma a na hi hi. Ngai inlen, na hoi nadingin kithei siem ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in a dawng hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka lungbuoina khu te thei hi hinlen, ka tuosietna teng kitawite thei le izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua khu tuipi senel sangin a gihzaw ding hi; tua ahi ziehin ka kamhamte a khauh kha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vanglienpa’ thaltang ka sungah om a; keima sungah a gu kidie hi; Pasien’ zauhuoinate in kei ei do dingin a kiguol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gam laate in lopa a neh ciengun hamin, ahi sihle bawngtang in butu a neh ciengin a awng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ci saw loin antui lote kine thei a, aatui lamte sungah a tuina a om amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuate dugaw-in ka ciem nuom sih a; tuate pen a luohsuohuoi an tawh kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka ngetna khu kinga hinlen, Pasien in ka lunggul ei pie ding hi le maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in keima ei mehcip nuom hinlen, ama in a khut hing hlasuhin ei that mai le izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami khu ka kihenepna ahi ding a; ka thuohna nangawnah nuomin ka kipah ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile keima in Siengtho Pa’ thu ka niel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in ka nga thaw nadingin ka thahatna khu bang ahei? Ka lungduoi zawh nadingin a tawpna-a ka nga ding khu bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thahatna khu suong’ thahatna ahi a, ka tahsa khu sumngo thahatna ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mantahin keima sungah huna ka nei sih a, panpi nget nading mi koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A khanguol pa a khuotuo lote in Vanglienpa giin dan a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Luitui khang bangin ka guolte a zuoutat vua, a kangkia hawhtui luong bang le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuikhal in a khahcip luitui le buon in a khucip vuakhal tui suoh bangin, amate a zuoutat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuo lum hun ciengin tuate a zungmang sieng uhi; nisa in a kah ciengin a opna vuah a gawkang sieng zieu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau’ lampi panin khuolzinte a piel vua; gamdai-ah amate peito-in a kisie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tema khuolzinte in tui a sui vua, Sheba khuolzinte a na kinem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kimuon ziehun a lungkie vua; amate kungah tungin a cimaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in kei adingin nohaw tua bang lel na hi vua, ka tuosietna mu-in na zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in, ‘Letsong khat nei pie ding vuoi?’ ahi sihle ‘Na neisa panun guhgol nei pie ding vuoi?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahi sihle, ‘Ka langpa’ khut sung panin nei hundam ding vuoi?’ ahi sihle, ‘Mi bawlsiete’ khut sung panin nei tan ding vuoi?’ kang ci ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ei hil inlen ka sip dide ding hi; bangci tatkhiel ka hei ci ei theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thuman kammalte bangza tahin vanglien ahei! Ahi vangin nei phawsietna in bang a phatuomsah ngel ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi mawsietna kammalte tawh thu hil thei-a kingaisun na mah, a cimawte thu gen pen huipi lang bang hi lel lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa nei lote tung nangawnah ai na san vua, na khanguol pa zong na dehkang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hinanle tu-in kang thum hi, keima ei en un; bangzieh ahei cile na maitang vuah kei ka zuou vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kilekia un, kang thum hi, khielna kibawl da taheh. Tu-in hing kihei vawi un, ka dihna a zauhuoi dinmun a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka hamkhiel bang om ahei? Ke’n ciemin tuosietna khen thei lo ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Leitungah mihingte in na hamsa a sem vua, tuale amahaw’ nite zong khu a kiciel nasem pa-a’ bang hi lel lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hlim lunggul sila khat tawh kibang a, lawman san ding kal a ngahla nasemte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n a mawhna-in hla tampi ka om a, zan tampi lunggimna khu keima’ tanh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lup ciengin keima in, ‘Bang hunin ka tho diei?’ ka ci hi. Ahi vangin zan khuo a sawt a, zing khuovah dongin ka kilumlele hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thanlom le buonnawi in ka citung a tuom hi; ka vun naikulin hima naite zong a pawtkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nite khu siemgante’ siemphei sangin gangzaw a, lametna om loin a mong tung paipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka hinkhuo pen husankhat beh ahi lam ei phawh in; Ka mit in sil hoi kici a mukia ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei na mukha ngai mit in ei mukia nawn lo ding hi; na mit tawh nei et laitahin kei ka mangthai ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meiilum kaite thengin a manthai bangin, Misikhuo-a peisuhte a katokia sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a inn vuah amate a kilekia ta sih vua, a munte un amate a thei kha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua ziehin ka kam ka ki-ip sih ding hi; ka lungkham ziehin ka ham ding a, ka genthei ziehin ka phun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang in ei cing ding na koi nadingin kei, tuipi ganhing ahi sihle gulhiempi ka hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lum leng nuom dawm vanin, kimu leng phatuom va,’ ka ci leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mangsie nei mansah a, mangmunate mu-in nei zausisah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaci’n ka pumpi in a hici thuoh sangin ei kilawlmehin si leng ka nuomzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hinkhuo ka cimtah ta a; kumtawna hing ding lah ka hi sih hi. Ka hinkhuo husan khat ahi bo ziehin ei hici opsah ta mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam za taha na thupi se ding le na lungsim sungah a gieh valia ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />zingmawng sielin vilin, a hun sima na ze-et dingin, mihingte bang hi lel ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bakhat sung beh mit tuhna-in ei nei loin, ka cilval zaw dong beh ei hici opsah phot lo ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang, mihingte encih pa aw, a khiel ka hi lezong nangma tungah bang pen gamta khiel ka hei? Bang dingin na muiciem dingin ei bawlin, bang dingin na vangih suoh laizang ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang dingin ka tawnkhielna ei ngaidam loin, ka khielna ei lahpieh lo na hei? Tu-in lei lahah ka lum ding a, nei sui vangun ka om sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shuh mi Bildad in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bang tanvei tam thute gengen ding na hi a, bang tanvei na kama na thu gente huipi lang bang ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien in thutang a lehei amah? Ahi sihle Vanglienpa in thudih a lepei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ langkhatah na tate in mawna a bawl uleh, ama in a khielna vanglietna sung vuah amate a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien sui-in Vanglienpa tunga na thum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />siengtho-in na thudih po leh, ama in ang en valon ding a, ama in nangma’ mun ngai ma-ah ang koikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kipatna khu thupi sih nanle, mailam-ah na thupi mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A tawpsa hunlui thute kantel inlen, a pu a pate uh’ na mukhiet thute ngaisun in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />eite pen zani mi i hi bo ziehun bangma i thei sih uhi, bangzieh ahei cile i leitung hinkhuo khu ni hlim bang bep ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in nang hing hilin, a thu hing genin, amau’ theitelna sung pana ang gen ding uh ahi sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Cianawng a op lona-ah pumpeng kung po thei ding amah? Tui op lona-ah pumpeng pung thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuate a paa laitahin a kivat sih zongin adang kungte sangin vul baizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien mangngilte’ lampi tua bang ahi hi; Pasien a thei lo mite’ kinepna tawpin mangthai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau’ kimuonna khu vauzam ahi bo a, amau’ kingapna zong khu momthang ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A inn tungah mi khat kingam leh, tua inn in puo zo lo ding hi; a khut tawh mi khat in tu paupau leh tua pen kip zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mi gilote nisa lahah a luhing thei vua, umlai-ah a bamengte a zam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suong kiciengte kimvelah a huite kiviel a, suongkawmte lahah tuate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A mun panun amate kisusie leh, amate in a niel ding vua, ‘Ke’n nang kang mu ngai sih hi,’ ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />En vawi, tamte khu amau’ nopsahna lampi ahi a, tuale adangte zong lei lah panin ang podawh lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“En in, Pasien in bangma cihin genbaang lo mipa nuol ngai lo ding a, gitlona a bawlte panpi lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in na kam dimdimin ang nuisah ding a, na kam tawh kipahin na awng vapo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma ang mudate maizumna puon kisilsah ding a, migilote’ puonbuh om nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tua bang hi, ci ka thei tahtah ta hi; hinanle Pasien mai-ah mihing bangci dih thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat ama tawh a kisel nop leh, tua pa in tulkhat ah khatvei zong ama dawng thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama pen a lungtang pil a, a tha zong a hat hi. Koi pen in ama do-in a guolzo ngel ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muolte a khin pa ama pen amate in a thei vateh sih uhi, ama a lungthah ciengin amate a khup a thalin a tusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in ama’ opna panin leitung lawh a, a khuomte a kithingsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in ni thupie a, tuale ni suoh lo hi; ama in aasite zong a humcip hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama beh in vanpi zah a, Tuipi tuihuolte a tuoncil hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama pen Ngambawm, Zawlzawng Bawmluoi, le leitaw lam aasite a bawlpa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama in koima’ theitel zawh lo na lienpite bawl a, koima’ sim sieng zawh lo na lamdangte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En in, ka kungah ang suoh a, ken ama ka mu sih hi; ama pei kawikawi a, hinanle ama ka thei thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in tawmang ta hi; koi in khahtan thei ding ahei? Ama kungah, ‘Bang bawl na hiei?’ koi in ci ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pasien in a lungthahna dawhkia lo ding hi; ama’ nei-ah Rahab panpite a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahile ama bangci dawn thei-in, ama tawh ka kiho nadingin ka kammal bangci teel ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Maw peng hinan leng ama ka dawng thei sih hi; keima ei mawsah pa kungah hepi ding ka nget kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama hlanin ei dawng nanle ka aw ei ngaipieh dingin ka um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in huipi in ei mutpaisah a, ama in a thu omlo pi-in ka liemna khangsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ama in ei naasah man sih ding a, lungkhamna tawh kei ei kidimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thatanghat kidemna ding hi leh, ama a thahat ahi bo hi! Thutang kitu ding hi lei zong zumah koi in ama va hlan zo ta ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei a mawpeng hinan leng, ka kam in ei mawsah put ding hi; maw baang lo hinan leng zong, a letat ei hisah veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei genbaang lo ka hi hi; kei le kei ka kithei sih a; ka hinkhuo ka kidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A unpi-in khat ahi hi; tua ahi ziehin ama in, genbaang lote le a gilote a nipi-in a susie hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuosietna in thakhatin sina ang piensah ciengin, ama in a genbaang lote’ tuosietna nuisan zieu lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Migilote’ khut sungah leitung kipie hi; ama in ama’ thukhente’ mit a humpieh hi. Tua khu ama ahi sihle a koi dang hi ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A tai mipa sangin ka nite gangzaw hi; tuate in na hoi mu loin a lengmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pumpeng gunkuong bangin a nawpei vua, muvanlai sa bawh tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Ka phunna ka mangngil ding hi; ka damai khelin kimaitaisah vang,’ ci zong nanleng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ka gentheina teng giin citahin ka giing hi. Azieh pen nang in lah midihin nei bawl lo ding lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A maw tang ding veve ka hi hi; tuale bang dinga gimna ka ci thuoh laizang adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Savan tawh kisilin tang-al tui tawh ka khut sawp sieng hi leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nangma in ehdum sungah nei phum suh veve ding a, ka puonsil mama in zong keima ei kidah ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen ama ka dawnkia thei nadingin ama kei bangin mihing ahi sih a, zumkong mang konga kihehpi thei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koma gel tungah khut hlang ding mi a om sih a, koma gel kikalah phit-mut ding mi koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in kei kung panin ama’ ciengpum hing ladawh a, ama in ei lunghimaw sah nawn loin, ei zausah nawn sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuaci’n kei zau loin ama ka hopi thei ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile ka kingaisut bang ka hi lo lam ka kithei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka hinkhuo ka cimtah hi; ka nopnopin ka phun ding hi; keima in aicim-tangkha tawh a kibang ka hinna ka sutsut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in Pasien kungah, ‘Kei ei mawsah da in; bang dinga ei do bawl na hei, ei theisah in,” ka ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima ei kigawt bawl a, na khut tawh na sepsate kisimmaw-in, migilote’ nasepna angvan ding khu nangma’ hoi sah ma amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cilesa’ mit na nei amah? Mihingte mu bangin na mu amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nite, mihingte’ ni tawh kibang amah, ahi sihle na kumte zong mihing’ kum ma tawh kibang ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in ka khielna nei sulzui a, ka mawna na kantel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang in kei ka khiel lo lam na thei mawh vangin na khut sung pana ei hunkhie ding koima a om sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khut tawh keima ei lomin nei bawl hi; tu-in kihei-in keima nei susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei tungman tawh nei bawlna hing phawhkia in; nangma in kei leivui ei suohsah sawmkia na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawngnawi suh bangin keima ei suhin, bawngnawi khal bangin ei khalsah hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vun le satel tawh nei tuom a, gute le thahuite na kimatsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma in hinkhuo le itna kip nei pie a, nangma’ ei kepna in ka hinkhuo a humbih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle na lungsim sungah tam silte na im lai hi; tam pen na lungtup ahi lam keima in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima ka maw leh nei kaihlit a, ka khielna nei maisah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka gitlo leh gimna ka thuoh hi! Ka thuman leh ka lu ka pongsah thei sih hi, azieh pen ka gentheina ka et ciengin, mindaina tawh ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Humpi bangin kei nei vai hi; nang in kei langkhatah a zauhuoi nate na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima ei mawmat dingin tecite a tha na khel a, kei lamah nangma’ lungthahna a khang semsem hi; nangma in kei ei do dingin galkap a tha tha nang puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bang dingin ka nu sung panin ei na piengsah poma na hei? Koima’ ei na mu masangin na kisi dawh ta ve leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale ka nu sung panin hankhuh ei na kitut pai hinlen, a na kipieng kha lo hi tamai le izaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nite tomkal khat sung hi lo amah? Keima in themno khat lungnopna ka mu thei nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kang kinuale nawn lo nading gam le lungzinna le khuomiel gam ka zot masang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khuovah khuomiel tawh a kibahna, lungzinna le buoina gamah ka pei masangin, keima ngentangin ei omsah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Naamath mi Zophar in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kamham tamza pi dawn loin hing kikoi-in, mi kamtam pa dih kitang sah ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thumot gengente in midangte sipsahin, tuale mi na simmaw ciengin koima in ei maizumsah sih va na ci amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen, ‘Ka gamtat dan a siengtho a, Pasien muna-ah ka siengtho hi,’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle na kungah tua Pasien in a kamkahin hing hopi hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />pilna thusimte hing hil leh nuom man vang e izaw! Bangzieh ahei cile pilna pen nam tampi ahi hi. Tua ciengin Pasien in na khielna za sangin a tawmzaw ang thuh ahi lam thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Pasien’ thuthuhte mu sieng thei ding na mah? Vanglienpa’ sep theina tan mu zo ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua khu vantung sanga sangzaw ahi a, nang in bang law thei na hei? Misikhuo sangin thuhzaw hi, nang in bang thei zo ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tena pen leitung sangin sauzaw a, tuipi sangin zong zaizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in hing nawh kha-in thong sungah hing khum hinlen, tuale thu khen dingin hing kaikhawm leh, koi in ama khahtan zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile ama in kimanna nei lo mite thei hi; ama in mawna a mu ciengin ngaisun loin om ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle gam laate mihing a suo ciengin mimawte in theitelna nga pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na lungsim mansah lacin ama lamah na khutte na zah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na khutah khielna a op khah leh paidawh inlen, na puonbuhte sungah gitlona tengsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin nuolna om loin na khuodah ngam tahtah ding a; lung muongin omin na zau ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang in gimna na mangngil ding a; tua khu a luongsa tui bangin na phawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na hinna khu sun sangin vahzaw ding a; a khuomielte, zingmawng bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lametna a op ziehin kimuonna na nei ding hi; nang ang kipanpi ding a, bihtahin na tawlnga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang na lum ding a, koima in ang zausah sih ding hi; mi tampi in nangma’ maipha ang sui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle migilote’ mit thazaw ding a; amate adingin suotahna lampi zosie tawp ding hi. Tuale amau’ kinepna khu si ding beh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Noma beh mi kisa na hi vua, noma tawh pilna a si ding lam upla nading om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle no bangin theitelna ka nei hi; note nei-ah ka om sih hi. Tam bang thute koi in thei lo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka guolte nuisatin ka om ta hi; Pasien ka hlan a, ama in ei dawng hi, a dih le paubaang lo mipa, mite’ nuisatin ka om ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nop a thei-a om mite in hamsiet tuohte a ciemmui bawl uhi, hinanle a keng vua dingkip thei lote a pua ding uh a baisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gutate’ puonbuhte a om hit hiet a, Pasien a lungthahsah mite bihtahin a om uhi, amate in a khut sung vuah a pasien uh’ lim a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ahi vangin gamsate dong un, amate in note ang hil ding uhi; vana leng vate dong un, amate in no kungah ang gen ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />leitung singkungte dong un, amate in ang hil ding uhi; tuipi sunga ngate dong un, amate in ang gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ khut in tami a bawl lam tamte zosie lahah a thei lo koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khut sungah ganhing zosie’ hinna le mihing zosie’ hinna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei in an a ciep bangin bil in thu kantel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khanghamte in pilna a nei vua, a sawt hinte in theitelna nei hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pasien in pilna le hatna nei hi; ama in thukuppina le theitelna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a phelkhe nah leh koima in lamkia zo lo hi; ama in thongah mi a khum nah leh koima in lakhie zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in tuinahte khacip leh leitang gaw-in tuite kang sieng hi; ama in tuite a hla ciengin tua tui in gamsung hlummang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in hatna le pilna nei hi; misolte le sol thuohte ama-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in thudawhpite a guohtangin puimang a, thukhente mimaw suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in kumpite’ kawnggah khau sutpieh a, dielkai tawh a kawng uh a khipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in siempute a guohtangin puimang a, mi hatte zong a khule thop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in mite’ muonte a ham thei loin koi a, khanghamte’ thu khinkhai theina a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in miliente simmaw bawl a, mi hatte’ kawnggah sutpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in khuomiel panin thuthuhte pholah a, ama in khuomiel thuhpi khuovah a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in minamte liensah a, tua ciengin tuate a susie hi; ama in minamte liensah a, tua ciengin a puimangkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in leitung makaite panin theitelna lamang a, lampi oplona gamkhing ah amate a vahvaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuovah omlo khuomiel lahah amate a kimaimaw vua, zukhamte bangin amate a hawilensah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“En vawi, ka mit in tamte zosie mu zo a, ka bil in za-in thei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No thei teng ken zong ka thei hi; no sangin ka niemzaw tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in Vanglienpa kungah ka gen ding a, Pasien tawh ka vai ka kiniel nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in ahile zuouthu tawh na melh uhi; na unpi-un kimanna a nei lo zatote na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ham lo phun loin om locin, tua khu na pilna uh hizaw ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in ka thu ngaisutnate za unlen, ka kam tawh ka thusunte ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien ading a dih loin genin, ama adingin zuou le nalin gen ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in ama angvanin Pasien tangin thu phu ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in note hing encien leh hoi na vang na kici ding uh amah? Ahi sihle mi khat in adang khat a sol bangin ama sol zo vang na ci uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Angvanna na zah dap uleh ama in note ang phawhsie valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama’ thupina in note ang zausi sah ding a, na tung vuah ama giinna hing tung ding hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khanglui thupomte uh vutvai bang bep ahi a, na mi nielnate uzong tungman kidalna bang bep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sip dide unlen, kei thu ei gensah un, keima tunga a pieng popo a pieng hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ha tawh ka tahsa petin ka tawdawh ding a, ka khut sungah ka hinna ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En vawi, ama in kei ei that ding hi; keima in kinepna ka nei sih hi; ahi vangin ama’ maitangah ka kihunna thu ka gen veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam pen ka hutdamna hi ding a, ama mai-ah migilote ang pei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thugente limtahin ngai unlen, na bil vuah ka thu pulahte lutsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thu a gen dingin a baisa-in ka om zo hi; ka thu ka zaw ding lamtah ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khumnah kei tawh a kihau ding koi ahei? A op leh sip tahin omin ka kisi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tungah thu ni beh ei pie inlen, tua ciengin na mai panin ka kiphuol sih ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima kung panin a gamla-ah na khut dawhkia inlen, zauna ei thuohsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin ei hlan in, kang dawng ding hi; ahi sihle kei ei gensah inlen, keima ei na dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mawna le ka khielna bangza pha ahei? Ka khielnate le ka mawna ei theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bang dinga na mai na phuol a, na gal banga nei ngaisut ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang in hui in a mutmang singna zausahin, butu gaw nuadel ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen keima’ langkhatah ka thu a siehuoi-in na giel a, ka khangno lai-a ka khielnate a ga nei atsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka keng siakol ei bulpiehin ka lampi zosie nei kaihlit a, ka kephang dong nei melci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ziehin a muot na khat le nget in a neh puon bangin ka ngamguoi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Numei sung pana suoh mihing pen ni tawmno sung ma hing a, lungkhamna tawh a kidim hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama pen paape bangin pah a, a vulgawp kia pai hi, nihlim’ pei tawh a kibang a, sawtveipi a hing sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua bang bep mi khatpo mittuhna-in na nei amah? Thukhenna a thuoh dingin na kungah nei peipi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A siengtho lo nate lah panin a siengtho a tun thei ding koi ahei? Koima ta a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hinkhuo nite uh laitansa ahi a, tuale hla bangza hing ding ci na thei hi, amate in a kansan thei lo dingun a nite uh na ciengtanpieh zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amate in a kiciel nasemte bangin a hinkhuo nite uh nuom a sah nadingun, amate kimumaw bawl inlen pelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Azieh pen singkung khat adingin kinepna om buong sam a, tua khu kiphua nanle mengkia-in tua a bamengte a si sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei sungah a zung muotin a bulsum si den zong nanle,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />guo a zuh ciengin nokia ding a, singtuoi bangin a bate mengkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin mihingte si-in a maimang ta uhi; mihingte a hinna uh tawp a, tuale amate hei-ah a om uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dim sunga vei tui a kan gaw bangin guntui luonglai zong kiemin a kang hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaci’n mihingte si-in a thokia ta sih uhi; vanpi a bei masangsie a khanglo ta sih ding vua, ahi sihle a kimutna uh panin amate a khanglo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misikhuo-ah keima ei phuol mai ven, na thangpaina a ven masangsie ei phuoldap inlen, kei adingin hun khat se-in ei phawhkia bo in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte si leh a hingkia ding vuoi mah? Kei ei kihla hun a tun masangsie ka nasepna ni cinteng khu ka ngah kenkon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei nei hlan ding a, kang dawng ding hi; na khut tawh na nasepna na lunggul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen tua ciengin nang in ka kalsuonte na sim sih ding a, nang in ka mawna zong nei encih nawn sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka thupalsatna teng ip khat sungah kiguong ding a, nang in ka khielna teng nei khupieh ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ahi vangin muolte cimin guoicim a, a opna panin suong kikhin hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tui in suongte nemang a; tuisan in leithau tawmang sieng hi; tuaci’n mihingte’ kinepna na suhsiet pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tawntungin amate na zo a, tuale amate a si uhi; a maisuo uh na khelpieh a, amate na sawlmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A patawi dingin a tate a pei vua, tuale ama in a thei sih hi; amate kingiem koih a, ama in a na phawh ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in a pum tung vua om natna beh a phawh vua, tuale amate ading behin a kap uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Teman mi Eliphaz in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipil khat in hui tawh a kibang a kimang lo kamhamte dawngin, nisuona lam hui hawpin a kigil vasah ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Phattuomna a om lo thute tawh kiselin, ahi sihle a sil hoi bawl thei lote uh a mawh gengen ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang in Pasien zatahna na sumaimang a, Pasien’ mai-a thu lungngaina na khahtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen na khielna in na kam thu hil a, mi pilkhelte’ kam na teelzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma’ kam in nang ang mawsah a, kei ka hi sih hi; na kam in nangma langkhatah teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mihingte lahah a pieng masa pen na hi amah? Muolte a op masanga pieng na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien’ thu kikupna na ngai kha amah? Nangma ding beha pilna na ciengtan amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kote thei lo bang thu na thei tuom ahei? Kote telcien lo bang thu na theisiem tuom ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kote lamah puteh samkangte a om vua, amate na pa sanga a tazaw vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in ang henepnate ahi sihle awnem no tawh ang hopina te nang adingin thuneu na sa amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang dingin na lungsim in ang puimang a, bang dingin na mit sat liplap na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n na lungsim in Pasien a langpan a, na kam panin tua bang kammalte pusuohsah na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte bang hi tuon a, amate siengtho thei ding uh ahei? Ahi sihle numei pana pieng mite khu a thuman thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’ misiengthote nangawn Pasien in muong loin, ama muna-ah vantungte zong siengtho sa lo ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a kidahhuoi, a siehuoi, khielna tui banga a dawn mipa khu bang a ci muonla kan lai diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Keima’ thu ngai in; kang lah ding hi; ka musate kang pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipilte in gen pena a nei ule a pu a pate un zong a na im lo uh khu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />amate tung behah gam na kipie a, amate lahah khuol mite a vahkha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Migilote in a khan tungtawnun natna thuohin a kipumpeh vua, mi gawgamte adingin tuate a khan tungtawnun a kikoipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A bil sung vuah patauna aw ging a; a cithei hunun zong amate tungah mi susie pa pei-in amate a bulu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Miel pana a kilekia ding uh lametna a om sih a, amate, namsau tawh si dinga laitansa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Neh ding sui-in mun zosie-ah vah kawikawi-in, amate in, ‘An neh ding hei-ah a om diei?’ a ci uhi. Amate in khuomiel hun ang nai lam a thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />lungdonna le lungzinna in amate zausisah a, gal bawl dinga kithawi kumpi khat bangin amate a zogawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in Pasien langkhatah a khut uh zahin Vanglienpa a pumtawh ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ama langkhatah lum sapi khat tawh lungkhauhtahin a tai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />azieh pen amau’ thaute in a mai uh tuom a, a phua vuah a thaute uh kikhol hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a daidam khuopite ah a teng ding vua, koima’ ten lona innte, le buathah lom suoh dinga kisesa innte sungah amate a teng ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />amate a hau sih ding vua, a neisate uh zong kip loin, lei nei-ah zong amate a zunghla sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />miel panin amate a suohta sih ding vua, a bamengte mei in hulvamin, hui in amau’ paate tawmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amau le amau kisolin a hawmpi muong sih uheh; azieh pen amau’ lemlaw khu a hawmpi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hun a tun masang gawp sieng ding a, a bate a na a nokia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in lenggui bangin a ga puomte a thingdawh ding vua, tuale olive kung bangin a paate a pulsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien a thei lo honte in suonlehlah a nei sih vua, guhgol tawh kilam puonbuhte mei in a katum sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in sil hoilo paai-in sietna a piengsah uhi. Mi sol ding behbehin amau’ lungtang a kithawi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tua bang thute ka zaza zo hi; na unpi-un mi gimsah bep mi henemte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hui tawh a kibang kammalte in ciengtan nei lo amah? Ahi sihle bang in ang tawhthaw a, tuaci mawh hamham na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei munah note om locin, note’ gen bangin ke’n zong ka gen thei ding hi; note’ langkhatah thu tampi ka gen thei a, ka lu zong kang peisan thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kamgum tawh kang henem thei a, ka lei in na natna uh ang nuomtuomsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thu gen leng lah ka natna a nuomtuom tuon sih a, keima ki-ip kenkon leng bang za-in a nuomtuom diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in Pasien in ei gimsah tahtah a, ama in ka innkuonpi zosie susie siengzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ama in ka maivun a tunsah zo a, tua in ka tungah teci-in a pang hi; keima langkhatah ka gawnna ding to a, ka maitangah teci-in a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lungthah ziehin ei bottel a, keima ei muda hi; ama in a ha ei gawisan a, ka langpa in keima ei en vapom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ei zako dingin amate a kamkah vua, simmawna tawh ka phe ei beng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in migilote’ khut sungah ei na pie a, Pasien thei lote’ khut sungah ei na ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nuom op laitahin ama in tun ni ei suo a; ama in ka ngawngah ei manin ei guoicimsah hi; ama in kei muiciemna-in ei nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a thalkapte in kei ei kimkot uhi. Ama in kei ei hepi vawt loin ka kalte ei kapvang a; ama in ka sinkha tui lei lahah a sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in ei liemsah thuothuo a; galhangpa bangin ei del vapual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka vun tungah la-ip puon ka khui a, leivui lahah ka thahatna ka sielsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kaa kaana-in ka mai san gawp a, ka mitkhu tungah tumde a kikap den vawt hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka khut sungah tatsietna om nanle keima’ thungetna a siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Leisiet aw, ka sisan khucip sin; keima’ kikona in khawlmun musah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu nangawnin van ah ka teci pa om a, a sangna munah ei panpi ding ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka guolte in kei ei zako vua, Pasien kungah ka hlitui a luong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat in a guolpa ading a thumpieh bangin Pasien kungah ei thumpieh ding mi khat ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kum tawmno zaw ciengin kang kilekia nawn lo nading lampi-ah ka pei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungsim kitamzan a, ka nite tawp zo hi, kei adingin hankhuh a baisa-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi zakote keima’ kimvelah om tahtah a, ei phinnate uh mit hla loin ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei adingin nangma vankhapin hing kipie in; tuanah kei dinga ang kikham ding koi ahi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang in a theitelna lungsim uh na khapieh hi, tua ahi ziehin nang in amate na guolzosah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thaman a dei ziehin a guol a leheh mite- a tate uh’ mit in khuo mu lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ama in kei pen mite’ thusie gentena ei suohsah a, mite in a mai vua a cilphit pa ukhu keima ka hi ta mawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka dana lamin ka mit mang a, ka khut ka kengte niliep a bang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thutang mite in tam thu ziehin lamdang a sa vua, Pasien thei lote tungah mawpengte a lungso uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle thumante in amau’ lampi a tukip vua, tuale khut siengtho nei amate a thahat tehteh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin note na unpi-un tu-in hing peikia un, keima in note lahah mipil khat zong ka mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nite lah a tawp zo ta a, ka gelnate zong maimangin, ka lungsim sunga ka lunggulte thelthang sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in zan pen sun a suohsah vua; amate in, ‘Khuovah in miel neh ta,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka inn bangin Misikhuo ka lamet a, miel lahah ka lupna pha leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />keima in Hankhuh kungah, ‘Nang ka pa na hi hi,’ ci-in, thante kungah, ‘Nang ka nu na hi hi,’ ahi sihle, ‘Ka sanggamnu na hi hi,’ va ci ta leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka kinepna hei-ah a om ta diei? Koi in ka kinepna a mu ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami khu Misikhuo’ kotgolte-ah a kumsuh ding amah? Leivui lahah i peisuh ton diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shuh mi Bildad in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na gen ding thute bang tanvei sui ding na hei? Khuongai inlen, kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang dinga ganhing banga nei ngaisut ahei? Bang dinga na mai-a mimaw suoh uh ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungthah zieha nang le nang ki-ehtel pa, nang ziehin leitung kitaisanin ahi sihle suongtum a mun panin kikhin va na ci amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Migilote’ khuovah kisumit tahtahin, a mei kuonglai uh a vah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puonbuh sung vua khuovah miel a, amate tunga meivah mit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kal sausuonte uh a tomsuon ta vua, a thugelte uh amate in a pualaw ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in lenthang sungah a keng a heng kha vua, kuokhuh tungah a vah kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thang in amate a ketul-ah man a; thangkhau in amate a khibawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuolah amate kisiena thangkhau kiphuol a, amate adingin lampi ah thang kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kim a pam vuah patauna in amate zausisah a, a kalsuonna cinteng vuah a sulzui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A gilkiel ziehun a tha uh tawp a, a pua nadingun tuosietna a baisa-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Natna in a vun uh netum a, Sina’ tacil in a khut le a keng uh a netum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A muon uh ahi puonbuh panin amate ki-ehmal a, patauna kumpipa kungah amate kitut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A puonbuh sung vuah bangma om lo a, a tenna uh munte tungah kat suong kithezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nei lamah a huite uh gawta a, a bate uh zong a gawptum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung panin a kiphawna uh kisie a, amate in lampi-ah min a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuovah panin khuomiel sungah amate kisawnpua a, leitung panin amate kinotmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a mite lah vuah cihlah ahi a, suonlehlah ahi zongin a nei sih vua, a tenna ngai mun vuah koima khat beh a hing nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nitumna lama teng amate in amau’ thuohna a cizatlia vua, nisuona lam mite zong a linglawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tah tahin Pasien zatah lote’ tenna tua teng bang ahi a, Pasien thei lote’ mun zong tua bang ma ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Note in bang tanvei ei bawlsie-in na kamteng utawh ei genpaat ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in sawmvei tah nei hosie zo uhi; kei tunga na khielna uh na zum sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khiel tahpi ka hi leh zong ka khielna ka kipuoh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei ei langpangin no le no na kitawisang vua, ka zalatna khu ka mawna zieh hi na ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in a khiel dinga ei sesa ahi lam le ka kimvelah a len tawh ei khu ahi lam thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Tatsietna,’ ci-in ka kiko cieng nangawnin ei kidawng sih a, ka hlat vapo vangin thuman-a thukhen mi om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in nawtsuoh thei lo nadingin ka lampi a khah bing a, ka lampi khuo a mielsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ka vang ei hawkhieh pieh a, ka lu panin kumpi lukhu ei lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a munmun panin ei satguoi a, kei ka mangthai ta hi, ama in sing phungkal bangin ka kinepna a phungkal sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah a lungthahna kuontaw a, a galpa tawh a kibangin kei ei simtha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei ei sim dingin a galkapte ang kuon uhi; kei ei nan nadingin kulh a cieng vua, ka buh kimvelah galphuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ama in ka innpite tawh ei kigamlasah a, ama in ka meltheite zin a tangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hieng ka sante le ka guolte in ei taisan sieng ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka inna ang tung ngai ka zinte in ei mangngil bawl ta uhi. Ka tengta numeite in zong zin bangin ei ngaisun vua; amahaw’ muna-ah khuolmi khat ka suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka nasempa ka hlan a, ahi vangin ama in ei dawng lo hi; ama ka zol kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka zinu in ka husan namsie sa a; ka innpite adingin ka kidahhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangnote nangawn in kei ei simmaw ta uhi; ka din popo ciengin amate in ei gensie vangiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka guol ngaite in ei huo vua, ei na it ngaite in zong ei langbawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka satel le ka gute ka vunah a beh ta a, a hing lemlem ka hi tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No ka guolte aw, kei ei khuotuo un, kei ei khuotuo un, azieh pen Pasien’ khut in kei ei tham zieh ahi bo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien’ ei bawlsiet banga bang dinga nei genthei bawl vua, ka tahsa thuohna khu na lungkim nai vaset sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka thugente lai-in kigiel hinlen, laibu khat sungah kigiel leh nuom sam vang e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hanawh peh tungah tua teng sekhu tawh kikhen hinlen, a om den dingin suong tungah kigiel leh ci sam ing e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in kei ei Tanpa a hing ahi lam ka thei a, ama in ni tawp ni ciengin leitung ah keima ei dinpi ding hi, ci zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua bangin ka vun a kisiet zaw ciengin, ka tahsa-in Pasien ka mu ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka gei-a Pasien khu ka mu ding a, ka mit in midang en loin ama ka en ding hi. Tuami khu ka ngahla sengin lung tawp dihdehin ka om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Note in, ‘Ama bangci bawlsiet ding,’ na ci vua, ‘A thuzungpi ama kungah kimu hi,’ na ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />thangpaina in namsau tawh danpiehna hing tun ding ahi ziehin, tua namsau giing bo un. Tuaci’n thukhenna a op lamtah note in na thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Naamath mi Zophar in dawng hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na ngai vawi! Keima sungah ka lungtang a kitom ziehin ka ngaisutnate in ka dawnkia nadingin ei hantawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kizumsuona le mawmatna vive ka za a, ka dawnkia nadingin ka theina in a ban zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitungah mihing a kipiensah a patin migilote’ nopsahna khu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tomno kal sung beh ahi lam tanga tuona kipanin na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau’ duong sanna in vanpi holin a lutang uh meiilum tawh kidong nan ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />leivui kimutmang bangin kumtawnin a mangthai ding vua, amate a mungaisate in, ‘Hei sunga om uh ahei?’ a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zan mang bangin amate lengmang ding a, mukhahin a om nawn sih ding uhi. Zanlai mumang bangin delmangin a om ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate a mukhasate in zong a nuamu kia nawn sih ding vua, a tenna mun un zong amate a mu nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tate un mizawngte a mai-et ding vua, a khut utawh amau’ neisate a piekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pumpi uh moisuo nanleh, amate tawh leivui a suohton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A kam sung vuah gitlona hlum a, tua khu a lei vuah a phuoldap vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a set dawh ding uh pamaisa-in, a kam sung vuah muommuom nan uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a gilpi sung vuah a annehte uh ang kikhule kia ding a, a sung vuah gulgu pha bangin ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in haunate a pumval vua, tua teng a lawkhekia uhi; Pasien in a gil sung panun tua teng a lahpieh kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in gulgu a tawp ding vua, muoltan tuhin a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in khuoizu le bawngnawi a luonna luidung le gunte mukha lo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nasep thaman zosie uzong a piekia sieng ding vua, amate in a haunate uh a zang man sih ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in mizawngte gawtin a pampai vua, a lam lo uh innte pi a mawh lahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A huoihamna un pha ta a ci ngai sih a, a huoiham ziehun bangma khat beh a hen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in a neh zaw ciengun bangma a valsah sih uhi; tua ahi ziehin amau’ lawcinna a kuitung vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A cithei pen hun laitahin lungkhamna a tuoh ding vua, hamsiet huoisiet cinteng amate tungah tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A du a dei kineh mai uheh. Pasien in a lungsona hladawhin amate tung le amau’ an tungah guo bangin zusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sia galhiem mai-ah amate a tai ding vua, sumngo thaltang in amate a kap pailet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thaltang a kidaw ciengin a pumpi uh pailetin a pei hi; a te lihleh thaltang mua in a sinkha uh a pailet a, amate tungah zauna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate adingin khuomu tawkhal kholsa-in om a, koima in a sem lo mei kuong in amate katum ding hi; A kinuasie a puonbuhte uh a ka sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vantungte in amau’ mawna pholah ding a, amate a do dingin leitung dingto ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien’ lungthahna tuikhang in a inn ule a neisate uh a tawmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami khu Pasien tung pana migilote satanh ahi a, amau’ gouluo dinga Pasien’ thukhenna ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka thugente limtahin ngai unlen, tami khu kei nei henepna hisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei ei thuohpi unlen, tuale kang gen ding hi; kang gen zaw ciengin ei nuisan mai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte tunga phun nei sa uh amah? Bang dinga lungtom lo ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ei en unlen, tuale lamdangsa un, na khut utawh na kam uh hum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam thu ka ngaisut khah ciengin lungdongin zau-in ka ci a tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang dingin migilote hinghing thei-in, a khankum uh sau zawsop a, hau zawsop uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hin sungun a tate a suong thei vua, a mitmu-un a hlah a suonte a cithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zauna panin a innte uh suohta a, a tung vuah Pasien’ moltum a tu kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A bawngtangte uh lan mama a, cihlah a nei den uhi; a bawngpite uh zong no a nei vua, a tatol ci bang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuuhon bangin a naupangte a vahsah vua, tuale a tate kipah tahin a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in tawmneu le lyre tumin la a sa vua, theile aw tawh nuom a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hinkhuote uh citheina-in a zang vua, lungmuong tahin Misikhuo a zuonsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in Pasien kungah, ‘Koma guoh ei omsah un! Na tawndan lampi uzong thei ka sawm sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’ na ka sep nadingun Vanglienpa khu bang ahi ahei? Ama kungah va thum uleng bang phattuompi ding ka hi uh ahei?’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau’ citheina khu a guolzawna uh hi lo amah? Migilote’ lunggelnate ka dei vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Migilote’ meivah bang zavei a kisumit ta ahei? Amate tungah tuosietna bang zavei a tung ta ahei? Pasien in a lungthah sulin a tung vuah bang zavei natna a tungsah ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hui in butute a mut bangin bang zavei a om ta uh ahei? Ansi bangin huipi in bang zavei a taw ta uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang in, ‘Pasien in a tate adingin a gitlonate uh a kholpieh hi,’ na ci hi. Amate in a thei nadingun a tung vuah kithuh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ mit in a kisietna uh mu hinlen, amate in Vanglienpa’ lungthahna tui bangin dawn uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amau’ ni le hlate a tawp ciengin, a nuasie uh amau’ innkuonpite bang a awlmaw ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in mun sanga omte thu a khen lam a theisa pi-in mi khatpo in Pasien thu a hil ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte a cithei laitahin a si vua, lungmuong le bihtahin a om uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a anneh a tuidawn kiningcingin a cintuigute kang nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte ahile genthei liengvai-in a si vua, amate in a hoi kici khat beh a ciemkha vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate a kibangin leivui lahah lumin, a pumpi tahsa tung teng vuah thanlompi a kihia valuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Aw, na ngaisutnate ka thei a, nei bawlsiet nadinga na gelnate ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang in ‘Sietna a bawl ulien pa’ inn hei sung ahei? Migilote’ tenna puonbuh ‘Hei sung ahei?’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khuolzinte thu dong ngai loin amau’ thugen na pom sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hamsiet hunin migilote kihingkhawi a, Pasien’ lungthah ni-in zong amate a suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amau’ maitangah koi in a gamtatna uh genkhie ngam ding a, a silbawlte uh dung zui-in koi in thuh ngam ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hankhuh ah amate a kizawn ciengin mite in a han uh kicingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amahaw adingin kuom sunga leisaite tui a, hlum a, mi zosie in a zui ding vua, tuale ama’ mai-a a peite kisim zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuale note in bangma lote tawh bang ei ci henep ding na hi uh ahei? Nei dawnnate uh bangma lo ahi a, zuou bulom pi ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Teman mi Eliphaz in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi khat Pasien adingin a kizang thei amah? A pil pente nangawn in ama’ na a sem thei uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang mi thuman na hi leh Vanglienpa adingin lungkimna om a, ahi sihle na lampite paubaang lo-a na koi leh, ama adingin phattuomna a om diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien na zatah ziehin ama in hing thuhilin, na tungtang thu ang khen ding ma amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na gitlona lien luo hi lo amah? Na khielnate in tawp hun a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen thuman lo pi-in na innkuon kung panin khapnate na la a, a nih a puonte uh hawhkhie-in, puon sil loin a guohtangin na omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A basamte dawn ding tui pie loin, gilkielte neh ding an na pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuneite in leitang a nga vua, tua tungah amau’ angvante a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang in meigongte a khuthawm in na notmang a, pa neilote’ ban na hliehtawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na kimvelah thang kikam a, zaunate in thakhatin ang nuoicip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi sihle na khuo mu lo nadingin khuomiel ang om a, tuikhang in nangma ang taimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Vansang pen dawnah Pasien om hi lo amah? En vawi, aasi sang pente khu sang va-ia kia sam e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nang in, ‘Pasien in bang ahei a thei, meiilum mielpi lah panin thu a khen thei diei?’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a mu thei lo nadingin meiilum sapi in ama khucip a, van mongah a vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilote’ lamhlahna lampi lui zui sawm lai na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A si hun uh a tun masangin lahmangin a om ta vua, amate tenna innmun zungpite zong tuikhang in taimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Pasien kungah, ‘Ko ngentang ei omsah in; Vanglienpa in kote tungah bang ei bawlpieh thei ding ahei,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle ama in a innsung teng uh sil hoi tawh a kidimsah hi. Ahi vangin migilote’ lunggel khu ka nahsah vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi thumante in a na mu vua, lungdamin a kipah uhi. Mawnei lote in amate a hosie vua, a nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Na langte suhmai-in a om tahtah ta vua, a nuasie teng uzong mei in katum sieng hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Pasien tawh kithutuoh inlen, ama tawh kilem in. Tua hile sil hoite in nangma ang zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’ kamsuo thuhilnate pom inlen, na lungsim sungah khol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vanglienpa kungah kilekia-in, na puonbuh sung panin thuman lona teng na hepmang leh, na pongtokia ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na kham neite leivui bangin ngaisunin, na Ophir khamte gun tawdop-a om suongpemte bangin bawlin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vanglienpa khu nangma’ ngun le kham ang hi po leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuaci’n Vanglienpa kungah nuom na sa ding a, Pasien’ mai-ah na mai na phongsang ngam ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama kungah thu na ngen ding a, ama in na ngetna ang za ding hi. Nangma in na kamciemte na tangtungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thu khensat khatpo na bawl ding a, tua khu hing kisuhkip piehin, na lampi tengah khuovah ang tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Midangte a kisimmaw ciengin a kilietsah zieh uh, na ci ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile ama in a neilut mite a hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in khielna a nei mite nangawn tankhie ding a, na khut siengthote ziehin amate hutdamin a om ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuni-a ka phunnate nasie mama a; ka tautau vangin ama’ khut a gih veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ka sui dan ding thei-in ama opna tung thei leng nuom sam vang e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama mai-ah ka thu ka sung ding a, ka kam dimdimin ka niel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ ei dawn dan dingte ka mukhie ding a, ka kunga ei gen ding teng zong ka thei siem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a vanglien pi tawh kei ei do ding amah? Hi lo hi; ama in ka thu ngai zaw lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thuman khat ama tawh holim thei ding a, ka thukhen pa in ka thu ei zosah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mailam ka nawh leh khumnah ama a om sih a; ka nuatawn le lah ama ka mu tuom sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />veilamah ama kiphuol a, ka mu thei sih hi; zietlamah ka kiheikia a, hinanle ama ka mu thei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in ka zawi teng ei thei hi; ama in kei ei zelah ciengin kham bangin ka pawtkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka keng in ama’ ketot nua a zui lenlon a; a lampi zui-in ka piel vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kam tawh ei thupiehna panin ka piel sih a, ka awp sungah a kam tawh a thugente ka vom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama a tuomin ding a, koi in ama zawl zo ding ahei? Ama in a dei teng a kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen kei dinga a sesate ama in ang bukimsah ding a, ama’ lungsim sungah tua bang tampi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama mai-ah ka zau mama a; ka ngaisut khah ciengin ama ka giintha a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien in keima’ lungsim zawmsah a, Vanglienpa in ei patausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuomiel lahah mangthai thei-in miel sapi in ka mai hing khu dawh leh nuom sam vang e!
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Vanglienpa in bang dingin hunte zui loin, ama a thei mite in bang dingin migilote tunga a thukhen ni mu kha lo uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilote in gamgi ciemtenate a khin uhi; amate in tuuhonte manin an a vah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in tagate’ laa a delmang uhi; amate in meigongnu’ bawngtang zong vankhapin a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in lam gei-ah tasamte a sawnpua uhi; leitunga mizawngte zosie a kiphuol dap sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Senel gam laate bangin neh sui-in a vah kawikawi uhi; a note neh ding an sui-in gam lahah a kizawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau-a’ ahi lo lo lai-ah an a la vua, migilote’ lengga lo-ah a sangh a khon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zan tungtawnin amate guohtangin a lum vua, tuale khuodam cienga kihui nading puon a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muoltung guotuite in amate a pah tehlopsah a, a kibuh nadingun suongpi pang a bel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A nu’ kang sung panin taga nausen a gu mite om a, mizawngte’ nausente zong vankhapin a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate puon nei loin guohtangin a kawiva vua, gilkielin lainem nan ule amate in buphaite a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A leicielte uh kikalah amate in sathau a suh uhi; amate in lengga tui a suh vangun, a dangta uh a pha tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuopi panin a laitat mite a tau vua, panpi ngai-in a liem a baite a kiko uhi; hinanle Pasien in a thumna uh donin a nei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Khuovah a langpang, tua khuovah lampite a thei lo, tua lampite zong a zui lo, mi pawlkhat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mizawng mi tasamte that dingin phalvahin tuolthat pa tho a, zan khuomiel hun sungin guta bulu-in a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Angkawmpa’ mit in khuomut ding kal a ngahla a, ‘Koima’n ei mu sih va,’ a ci hi; tuale ama in a maitang a sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in khuomiel lahah inn a lu uhi; sun lai-in amate kot a kikhalu uhi; amate in khuovah a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen amate adingin miel thuhpi pen zingmawng tawh kibang a, khuomiel zauhuoina tawh amate a kilawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tui maitang tungah amate malgang mama uhi; gam sunga amau’ satanh in samsietna ahi hi; a lengga lo vuah koima kuon nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Guotui kan hun le nisat hun in vua tuite hupkang hi; Tua bangin Misikhuo in maw neite a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naubu in amate a mangngil a; thanlomte in amate tuituoh a sa uhi; amate a kiphawh kha nawn sih hi; tuaci’n singkung bangin migilote a tawngsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Amate in ta nei lo numei a bawlsie vua, meigongte tungah na hoi a sem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien in ama’ vanglietna tawh mi thahatte’ hinkhuo sausah a; a hinkhuo a lunghimaw ciengun ang tho theikia na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in amate bihna pie a, amate huoi-in panpi hi; ama’ mit in a lampi uh a kaihlit den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate bakhat kisangtawi a, tua ciengin a mangthai uhi; amate paape bangin a vulmang vua; buvui ki-at bangin amate ki-attan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua bang hi sihle mizuou ci-in koi in ei gen ngam ding a, ka thugen zosie bangma hi sih, ci-in koi in ei lah ngam ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shuh mi Bildad in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pasien kungah uhna le zatahna om a, a sangna mun ama’ vantungah ama in kilemna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A galkapte a phaza koi in sim zo ding ahei? Koi tungah a khuovah tang lo ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien mai-ah mihing bangci dih thei ding ahei? Numei sunga pieng mihing bangci sientho thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama muna-ah hlapi nangawn tang sa zo lo a, aasite nangawn siengtho sa zo lo ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />than bang lel mihing, le talteng bang lel mihing, bangza-in a thupi sih zawkan lai diei!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hatna nei lo mipa bang na ci panpi ahei! Ban thahat lo mipa bang na ci hu ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna nei lo mipa thu bang na ci mop a, thu hoi bang na ci genpi thei ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thugente koi’ huna tawh na gen ahi a, koi’ lungsim pana hing pei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei nei-a misi hlate le tui le a sunga omte zau-in citun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien mai-ah Misikhuo a guohtangin om a, Sietna in zong asin a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Awnghawmpi tungah ama in Zaphon pha a, ama in bangma lo tungah leitung kikhaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a meiisapi sungah tuite tun a, tuate ziehin meiilum pawhkeh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlalia’ maitang khupieh a, tua tungah a meiilum kaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in khuovah le khuomiel kikalah a kigi bawlpieh a, ama in tuipi tungah kuolviel khat omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a hosiet ciengin vanpi kidona ahi khuompite zau-in a kithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A vanglietna tawh Tuipi daisah a, a siemna tawh Rahab satlia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hui tawh vantungte mut sieng a, a khut tawh gulpi tailai sun pailet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng khu ama’ nasep a mongno khat ahi na bo a, ama’ thu i zahte khu a hemlam beh ahi na bo hi! Hinanle vanto ging tawh a kibang a vanglietna koi in thei zo ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job in a thugen zomto a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka dihna ei lahpieh, genthei liengvai ei sinsah Vanglienpa a hing ahi ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka sungah ka naahu a om a, ka nahkuo-ah Pasien’ hu a op laisie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka kam in zuouthu kici gen loin, ka lei in mi solna kam a gen sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thuman uhi, kang ci vawt sih ding a; ka si dongin ka citahna ka hlasuo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thumanna ka tukip lenlon a, ka hlasuo sih ding hi; ka hin sungin ka lungsim in ei mawsah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka galpa, migilote bang hinlen, ka langpa, mi thuman lote bang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in a hinna uh lahpiehin, amate a suh maimang ciengin Pasien thei lote’ kinepna khu bang pen ahi bep diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tungah buoina a tun ciengin, Pasien in a kikona uh a za diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vanglienpa sungah amate in nuom a sa uh amah? Amate in hun bangkimah Pasien a ko ding vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in Pasien’ sil bawltheina tawh kisai thu kang hil ding hi; Vanglienpa tawh a omte ka im sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na unpi-un na mu zo ta uhi; tua ahile bang dinga a mawhna suoh na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tam pen migilote in Pasien kung pana a nga uh satanh le, mi bawlsiete in Vanglienpa kung pana a nga uh gouluo ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tate a pun vua ahi lezong namsau-a lo ding a hibo vua, tuale a suon a hlahte un khamkhop ding an a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hinglaite pulnatna in vui ding a, a meigong numeite in amate a kaa sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in leivui bangin ngunte sungvumin, buon bangin puonsil cieng nan ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />amate in sungvum kha thei ding a, hinanle thuman mite in tuate a sil ding vua, maw nei lote in tua ngunte hawm lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in vabu bangin inn a lam vua, lo ngaite in a lam uh buhte tawh a kibang bep bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hauna tawh lupna a zuon vua, ahi vangin a zop zo nawn sih ding uhi; amate khanglo-in a hah uleh tuate na om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zauna in tuikhang bangin amate pha a; zanin huipi in amate a semmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nisuona huipi in amate domto-in a mangthai uhi. Tua hui in a opna uh panin amate a tawmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate khuotuo loin a lehmang a, hui hat lah panin ahi thei za-in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua in amate khut behsanin, a opna panin a nuisan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngun kitawna khuh om a, kham kisiensahna mun om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei sung panin sia kito a, suong panin sumsan kihuontui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suongtote in khuomiel tawpsahin, a gamla pen mun dong, mielking le miel thuhpi sungah suongte a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in mi’ tenna panin a gamla kuom sungah lei sung tovang uhi; amate pen khuolzinte in a mangngil bawl vua, mite tawh kigamlatna munah khauhuol tawh amate kikhai linglengin a kivei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leisiet panin neh ding ang pieng hi; hizongnanle lei nei lam pen mei-a kihal bangin sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A suongte panin Sapphire pieng a, a leivui lahah kham a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Sasielne vate in tua lampi a thei sih vua, langta’ mit in tua mun mu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gamsa kisatheite in tuon ngai lo a, humpi zong pei ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Meituh suong tungah a khut a ngam vua, muol bulte lumletin a cimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in suong a vutvang vua, a mit un sil manpha namcin a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in gunnah zosie a sui vua, lei sunga kiphuol nate a pholah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hinanle hei sungah pilna kimu thei ding ahei? Thu theitelna mun hei sunga om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihingte in tua lampi a thei zo sih vua, tua khu a hingte gamah a kimu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui thuhpi in, ‘Ka sungah om sih,’ ci a, tuipi in zong, ‘Kohaw tawh omton sih,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pilna pen kham tawh kilei thei lo a, a man za ngun tawh kite thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir kham tawh a man kite thei lo a, a manpha onyx ahi sihle sapphire tawh zong kite thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kham le limlang in dem zo lo a, kham hoi-a kibawl nate tawh hlen thei hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Coral le suongvalte gentham vet lo a, tuikep sangin pilna manphazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia gama a pieng chrysolite suongmanpha tawh tekah thei ahi sih a, kham citah tawh zong a man kitekah thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tua ahile pilna hei pana hing pei ahei? Theitelna mun hei sunga om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua khu hinna nei mi zosie’ mit-ah a kiphuol a, tuale hui lahah a leng vate muna panin zong kiselcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sietna le Sina in, ‘Kam baleng tawh thu kigen khu ka bil utawh ka za zo uhi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Pasien in pilna lampi thei a, ama in a opna mun thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in lei mong dong en a, vansin nei-a sil om zosie mu sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in hui’ gihna bawlin, tuite a phaza ding te hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />guozuh nading thukip bawlin, keh kieh nading lampi a bawl lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ama in pilna mu-in phuongzah a, tua khu kipsahin a sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in mihingte kungah, Topa zatahna khu pilna ahi a, sietna pana kihepkhietna khu thu theitelna ahi hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job in a thugen zomkia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nidang hun Pasien ei cin lai bangin ka hinkhuo zilkia thei leng nuom sam vang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka lu tunga meivah a tan lai, khuomiel sunga ama’ khuovah tawh ka va lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka tangval thahat lai le ka buh sunga Pasien tawh ka kikhawl lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vanglienpa kei tawh ang omton lai, ka kimvelah ka tate a op lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bawngnawi-a ka keng ka sil lai-in, suongpi in kei adingin sathau tui bangin a pulsah hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuopi tunkotah pei-in mihon opna munah ka to ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ei mu khangnote in tona ei awn vua, khanghamte zong a na ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi thupite a holim uh a khawl vua, a khut utawh a kam a hum uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />miliente a sip dide vua, a dangtawng vuah a lei a behsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite in a zah ciengun ei phat vua, ei mu ciengun ei thukimpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mizawngte le panpi nei lo tagate a kiko ciengin ka hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima tungah mi lungkhamte’ thupha ang tung a, keima in meigongte lungnuomin la ka sasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puon bangin dihna ka sil a; ka thutanna pen puontuol le dielkhim tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mittawte adingin a mit uh ka hi a, khelbaite adingin a keng uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tasamte adingin a pa uh ka hi a, melmahte’ vai zong ka dinpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuman lote’ ha ka suhtawngpieh a, a ha uh panin a sa neh uh ka khiehpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin, ‘Ka bu sunga a si dingin ka kingaisun a, ka nite zong senel banga a tam dingin ka ngaisun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tui sungah ka huite zam a, zan tawn tungin ka bate tungah daitui a taa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ka sungah ka vanglietna thasuo zing a, ka khuta thal zong a tha zing hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Amate in ka thugen ngai-in ei ngah vua, sip dide-in ka thuhilna a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka ham zaw ciengin a hamkia sih vua, ka thugente daitui bangin amate tungah taasuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in guotui nga bangin ei ngah vua; guo masa ngah bangin a kam a golkah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lungmuonna a nei lo ciengun amate ka nuimai a; amate in ka maitaina a sumang sam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uhpipa bangin ka to a, a lampi uh ka teelpieh hi, tuale a galkapte lahah kumpi bangin ka teng a, kei pen a date a henem khat tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ahi vangin tu-in kei sanga nauzaw, a pate uh ka tuucing uite za-a ka neumute in kei ei ciemmui bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khut thahatna uh panin bang nga thei ding ka hei? A thahatna zosie uh a tawp ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tasap zieh le gilkiel seng ziehin amate in gamgaw lahah singhuite a ngiet uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate in muolheu paa loin singnate a hlieh vua, munphie zungte tawh a kisanglum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipite tenna panin amate kidelmang a, guta khat a kidel bangin mite in amate a awhsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui gawta-a hawhlam kuoh lah le leihawm suonghawm lahah a ten uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sawlkawm lahah a peng vagua vua; a lomtangin lahkhai kawm lahah a kisengnawp valuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate pen kimanna a nei lo migina lo hon ahi vua, gam sung panin amate kinotmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tu-in simmawna la ei phuo vua; amau’ thusie gentena ka hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in ei kidah vua, ka kung panin a kikangkoi uhi; amate in ka maitang cilphi ding pen a kiheh vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in ka thalgui ei sattanpieh zieh le a neilut dinga ei koi ziehin, ka mitmu-in a nop bangun ei bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka zietlamah khangno tatsiete a ding vua; amate in ei gamdelin ka siet nading lam a siel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amahawn ka lampi susie-in ka tuosietna a khangsah uhi; amate a kham ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei hawmvang gol zui-in amate a lut vua, a sie nate lahah amate ang kilawmlia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima tungah zauna ang tung hi; hui in ka thupina a tawmang bangin ka citheina teng zosie zong meii bangin a theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tu-in ka sungah ka hlagau tui bangin kisung hi; gentheina nite in ei pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zanin ka gu ka tangte in ei ngiet a, tua ei ngiet natnate in khawl hun a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pauhat thu-in ka puon-ah ei man a; ka puon ngawngah ei gahcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in buonnawi lah ei denna a, vut le vai ka suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kungah kang kiko a, nang in nei dawng sih hi; keima ka dingto a, nang in nei hem-et bep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tungah nang gilo mama a; na banhat tawh nei bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hui lahah nei domto a, tua tungah nei tuongsah hi, nang in huipi ging lahah nei suhle nei tole hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang in sina zuon a nei zawpi ding ahi lam le mihing zosie dinga kisesa inn zuon a nei zawpi ding ahi lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuosiet hunin panpina ngenin a kiko ciengun koima in tua tasamte a khia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hin gentheite adingin kaa kituhte hi lo ka mah? Mizawng gentheite zong lung gimpi hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin sil hoi ka kinep ciengin silsie ang tung zawsop a, khuovah ka lunggul ciengin khuomiel ang letun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka sungkuo teng a kikhule gawp a, ka om ngim thei sih hi; nisim sielin gentheina nite ka tungah ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ni mu loin miel lahah ka vah a; mihonpi lahah dingin huna ngenin ka kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Si-alte’ sanggam ka hi ta a, va-kalaohte’ lawmpa ka hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vun dupin a hawtol a, ka gute zong mei-kamsa a bang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka lyre awging khu dana suoh a, ka theile zong si-uopte’ awging a suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka mit tawh thuciemna ka bawl zo ta hi; ngahnuno khat bangci et thei ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tung Pasien kung panin ka tanh ding bang hi a, a sanga a om Vanglienpa kung panin ka gouluo ding bang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thuman lote tungah tuosietna tungin, khielna a bawlte tungah gimna tung hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ka lampite thei-in, ka kalsuona zosie sim hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“A khiel lamin ka kalsuon a, zuou phuo dingin ka naw kalsuon leh-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tawikhaina man tawh ei kite hinlen, Pasien in ka citahna ei thei taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lampi man panin ka piel a, ka lungsim in ka mitmu teng zui-in, ka khutah a nieh khatpo a ban leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />midangte in ka vawsa ne hinlen, keima dinga kicingte kiphungkal taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Numei khat in ka lungsim a zawl zo a, ka vengpa’ kot gei-a ka buhdap leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka zi in midangte’ an suhpieh hinlen, midangte in ama luppi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khu a siehuoi gitlona ahi ziehin, thukhenna a thuoh ding khielna ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />azieh pen tua khu Sietna dong a katum thei mei hi ding a, tua meikuong in ka anlah ding teng halvam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka sila numei in ahi a, ka sila pasal in ahi zongin kei ei hehin thu ang bawl ciengin, amau’ thu ka niel leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaci’n Pasien ang dinto ciengin bang bawl ding ka hei? Ama in thu ang kan ciengin bang tawh dawng ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naubu sunga kei ei siempa in amate zong siem hi lo amah? Tuale naubu sungah eite pen khat’ ei siem hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mizawngte’ deigaw na khatpo ka hlaw a, meigongte a mitmang dinga ka bawl leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ahi sihle keima guohin an ka neh a, pa nei lote in an ka ngawlsah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a neu lai panin a pa bangin taga pa va-in, a nu sung pana kipanin meigongnu ka pui sihleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puonsil nei lo zieha mi a si khat, kihui nading a nei lo mizawng khat ka mu leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a lungsimin thupha ei pieh sih a, ka tuumul tawh ka huilum sih leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tunkotah ei panpi ding ka nei zieha tagate tungah ka khut ka lap leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka liengko a bulah kihlong hinlen, ka ban a bulah tawngsan taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima in Pasien tung panin gimna ka giin ziehin, ama’ thupina tawh ka kisi ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka muon pen kham ka hisah a, ka ngam pen kham hoite hi, ka ci leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ka hau seng zieh le ka khut in tampi a lam zieha kipah ka hi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ni a tan ciengin ka et a, thupi taha a tawn hlapi ka et leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ka lungsim ei dap zol ahi ta a, ka kam in ka khut ei daptawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam zong thukhente in dan a pieh ding khielna ahi a, tua ahi ziehin tung Pasien a niel ka suoh ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kei ei mudate kisietna ziehin ka kipah a, sil hoi lo in amate a phah cienga ka thangphat leh-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A si nadingun awsie suona tawh ka kam ka buasah ngai sih hi-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka puonbuh sunga omte in, ‘Luohsuoh vawtin a sa kineh lei izaw!’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lam dungah mikhuolte gieh ngai lo a, khuolzinte adingin ka kotte ka hong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midangte in a bawl bangin ka khielnate imcipin, ka lungsim sungah ka mawna ka seldap a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />mipi ka giin seng ziehin, innkuonpite phawsiet ding ka zau ziehin, sip dide-in, kot kal loin ka om hi-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka thugen a za ding mi khat om le maw! (Tanah ka min thuna om hi! Vanglienpa in ei dawng heh!). Ka langpa in ei hehna lai gielsa’n nei leh izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tahtahin tua lai ka liengko-ah ka puo ding a, mang lukhu bangin ka lu tungah ka khu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama kungah ka kalsuonna zosie ka sut ding a, milien bangin ama kung ka nai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Keima langah ka leitang kiko a, a tuma kuohte khu ang kaaton uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />sum pie loin a gate ka neh a, tua lo neite ka pulsisah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />mangbu tangin ling po hinlen, mangbuham tangin lopa po taheh,” a ci hi. Job’ thugente tawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama kimuna-ah thuman kisa ahi ziehin tam mihing thumte in Job a dawng nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ram innsung mi Buz-te Barachel’ tapa Elihu lungthah hi. Ama Job tungah lungthah hi, azieh pen Pasien sangin ama a kidihsahzaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Job’ guolte thum tungah zong a lung thah hi; azieh pen amate in Job khiel hi, ci-in a pholah vangun a dawn nading a thei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama sangin amate a tazaw ahi ziehun tu-in Elihu in Job tawh kiho ding a ngahngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam mi thumte in a dawn thei lo lam Elihu in a mu bepin ama lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Buz mi Barachel’ tapa Elihu in dawng a: “Kei ka khangno lai-in, note khangham na hi ta uhi; tua ahi ziehin na kung vuah ka ngaisutnate kang pulah ding ka zum a, zong ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in, ‘Tehsie lamte in thu gen hinlen, kum tam lamte in pilna hil uheh,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle a mantahin mi sunga om hla khu Vanglienpa’ hu ahi a, tua in theitelna a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khanghamte a pil ahi sih a, thuman theite zong khanghamte ahi tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, ‘Ngai un; kei zong ka ngaisutna ei gensah un,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“En un, na thugen uh ngai dingin ka na ngah a, gen ding na sui kawi lai-un, na pilkam gente uh ka ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Limtahin ka na ngai a, hinanle koima’n Job a niel zo sih a, note lahah a thugente a dawng thei koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin, ‘Pilna mu zo ta ung; ama a dawng ding pen Pasien ahi a, mihing ahi sih hi,’ ci sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ei kap nadingin thu a gen ngai sih a, note’ thugente tawh ama ka dawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amate a ciza vua, bangma a dawng sih uhi; amate in gen ding kam khat zong a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ham lo ziehun ke’n amate ngahin, khuna a din ziehun dawng nawn lo ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei zong kang dawng ding a, ka ngaitsutna zong ka pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen gen ding a dimin ka nei hi; ka lungsim a ki-ip zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lungsim pen pawtna ding nei lo a kibilcip lenggazu tawh kibang hi; lenggazu thawlthate bangin a pawhkhe dihtah ka bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thuoh zawh nadingin thu ka gen kul hi; ka kam kahin ka dawn kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Koima guptuom le paituom ka nei sih ding a, koima ka maitangphat sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen mi pawh dan ka thei sih a, pawh leng zong ei Siempa in ei sumang pai ding hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ahi zongin Job aw, tu-in ka thugen za inlen, ka gen zosie ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in, keima in ka kam ka kah a, ka kam sunga ka lei in thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thugente in ka lungsim dihna a pulah a, amate in lungsim tahpi tawh a gen lam ka kam in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien’ hlagau in keima ei siem a, Vanglienpa’ hu in hinna ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nei dawn thei leh ei dawng in; na thugen dingte ka mai-ah guol in; ka mai-ah ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En in, Pasien mai-ah kei zong nangma bang ka hi hi; kei zong tungman lom tawh ei na kisiem ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei nei giin nading a om sih hi; na tungah ka khut kang gihsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A tahtahin keima’ zahna ah na gen zo ta a, tuale keima in na thugen gingte ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang in, ‘Kei ka sieng a, ka khiel sih hi; kei ka siengtho a, ka sungah mawna a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En in, ama in kei ei suh nading paulap sui-in mu a, kei pen a galpa-in ei ngaisun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in ka kengah kol ei bul a, ka lampi zosie ei vil hi,’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hizongle tam thu-ah nang na thuman sih hi. Keima in kang dawng ding hi: Mihing sangin Pasien lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang dingin ama tawh kisel na hei? ‘Ka thugente khat beh ei dawng sih va,’ a ci na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien in lam khat, lam ni-in thu gen nanle mite in a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zanlai a lupna tung vua a haituh laitah uh, mite a ihsip laitahin mang le mangmuna sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a bil uh a honpieh a, hilkholna tawh amate zausahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a gamtatnate panun kiheisah a, kilietsahna pan kidawmsahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hankhuh panin amau’ hlagau le Gunpi kantanna panin amau’ hinna a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate zong lupna tungah natna tawh thuhil a, khawl loin a gu a tangte uh a na sah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaci’n a hinkhuo un an a kidah a, antuipen zong a lunggul ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ci a sa uh kiemin a kimu thei ta sih uhi; tuale a kimu ngai lo a gu a tang teng uh kidawh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hlagau uh Hankhuh neh ahi ta a, a hinkhuo uzong sina lam zuon ding ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi khat thuman hi, ci-in a tangko ding, vantungmi palai ding khat, tul ah khat bang om hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ama in tua mipa hepi-in ama kungah, ‘Hankhuh lam pei ding ama hunkhie in; ama tat nading sum keima’n ka nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />khangno-a’ bangin a ci a sa nosuokia a, a khangno thahat lai nite bangkia taheh,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Pasien kungah thu a ngen a, ama in a thungetna a sang a, lungdamin a mai-ah a pei hi, tuale ama a thuman ziehin Pasien in ama thuhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua pa in mi mai-ah la sa a, ‘Kei ka maw zo a, thuman ka lehei ta hi, keima tungah ei kithuhkia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in Hankhuh sunga pei ding ka hlagau ei tan zo a, ka hinna in khuovah a mu ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Pasien in mihingte tungah tam nate zosie nivei, thumvei bang a bawl ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />hinna khuovah a mu nadingun, Hankhuh panin amau’ hlagau a lahpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Job aw, ka thugen limtahin ngai in; sip dide inlen thu kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gen ding na nei leh ei dawng in; gen in, azieh pen nang dih kang tangsah nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na nei sih leh ka thugen ngai in; ham nawn sin, keima in ka pilna thu kang hil ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elihu in a genban zom a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“No mipilte aw, ka thugente za unlen, no thutheite aw, na bil uh na daw un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen dangso in an a ciep ma bangin bil in zong kammalte a sittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuman bang ahei ci teel vai; eite lahah a hoi bang ahei ciemte vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Job in, ‘Mawpeng ka hi a, Pasien in ka dihna a lamang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kei a thuman ka hi vangin mizuou-in ei kisim hi; suhkhiel nei lo hinan leng zong ka hima kidamsah zo nawn lo hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zakona tui dawn banga a dawn Job bang mi koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sil hoilo bawlte tawh kipawlin migilote tawh zawhton koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in, ‘Mi in Pasien sunga a nopsah ziehin a met bangma nga lo hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin no thu ngaisun theite in ka thugen za un. Pasien in gitlona bawl lo ding a, Vanglienpa in a man loin sem lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a sepna utawh kituohin ama in thuhkia ding a, a gamtatna utawh kituohin amate kungah a tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tahtahin Pasien in sil hoi lo sem lo ding a, Vanglienpa in thutang lehei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitung a uh dingin ama koi in ngansie a, koi in leitung buppi vai ama tungah nga ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a hlagau lakia hinlen, a hinna hu ama kungah hing khawm leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mihing zosie si sieng ding a, mi zosie leivui-ah a peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Theitelna na nei leh tam thu za inlen, ka thugen ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thutang muda mipa in uh ding amah? Thuman le a thahat pa mawpaih ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah koi in, ‘Nang miginalo pa! ci ding a, uliente kungah koi in, ‘Migilote,’ ci ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Koi in mithupite tungah maipha pie tuon loin, mizawngte sangin mihaute thupi ngaisutzaw tuon lo ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile amate a unpi-un ama’ khut tawh a siemsa hi lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate bakhat sungin a si uhi; zankim laitahin mite lingin a si uhi. tuale mihing khut tawh loin a thahat mite kikaimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Azieh pen a mit in mihingte’ lampi kaihlit zing a, a kalsuonna zosie uh mu sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Silsie bawlte kiphuol thei nading khuozing ahi sihle miel thuhpi om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in thukhenna thuoh a, Pasien’ mai-a pei ding hun koima adingin se tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in a thu kan loin mi thahatte gawtguoi a, amate munah midangte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua bangin amau’ nasepte thei ahi ziehin, zanlai-in amate lumletin tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Adangte in a et laitahin ama in a gitlona ziehun amate tehpuong hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />azieh pen ama a zuina panun a kihei vua, amate in a lampite a thupise sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuaci’n amate in ama kungah mizawngte’ kikona tungsah a, mi gentheite’ kikona a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama a ham lo ciengin koi in mawsah thei ding ahei? Ama in a mai a phuol ciengin, minam khat in hile, mi khatguoh in hile koi in ama mu thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien a thei lo mite, ahi sihle mi thangsiete in vai a hawm sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Azieh pen mi khatpo in Pasien kungah, ‘Dan ka thuoh zo ta hi; ka khiel nawn sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />ka mu lote ei hil inlen, mawna ka bawl leh ka bawl nawn sih ding hi,’ koi in ci ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama na niel ziehin ei lethuh kia va ci-a na ngaisut amah? Azieh pen nangma teel ding ahi a, kei teel ding hi lo hi. Tua ahi ziehin nangma in na thei thu hing pulah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thu ngaisun theite in keima kungah ang gen ding vua, ka thugen a za mipilte in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Job in a thei lopi-in thu gen a, a thugente khietna a nei sih hi,’ ei ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Migilote bangin a dawnkia ziehin Job tungah a tawpna dongin thu kikhen leh ka nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen a mawna banah ledo lai a, ama in eite lahah a khut bengin, Pasien langpanna kammal tampitah a genbe lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elihu in a thugen zom a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tam thu thutang hi, ci-in na ngaisun amah? Nang in, ‘Pasien’ mai-ah ka dih hi,’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang in, ‘Ke’n bang phattuomna nga ka hei? Maw leng bangci hoi zawh ding ka hei, ci-a na dawh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangma le na guolte kungah kang dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vante en unlen mu un; no sanga a sangzaw meiilumte en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A maw zo na hi leh ama bang sukha na hei? Na khielna a tam mama leh, tuate in ama bang a ci suhkhah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thuman na hi leh ama tungah bang na pie a; ahi sihle ama in na khut tung panin bang teng sang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na gitlona in nang tawh a kibang midangte sukha a, na thumanna in nang tawh a kibang adang mihingte ma a sukha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bawlsietna tampite ziehin mihonpi a kiko uhi; mihatpa banhat ziehin amate in huna ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin koima in, ‘Zan khang lai-a ei thakhausah, keima ei siempa ka Pasien hei-a om ahei?’ a ci sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />leitung ganhingte sangin thu ei tam hilzaw a, hui lahah a leng vate sanga a pil zaw-a ei bawl ahi hi,’ zong a ci sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khumnah amate a kiko vua, hinanle silsie bawlte a kilietsah ziehin ama in dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tahtahin Pasien in kikona hawmpite a za sih a, Vanglienpa in amau’ kikona a thudon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ka mu sih a, ka thu ama mai-ah a tung hi, ama ngah ka hi hi, na ci ciengin ama in na thu bang ang ci tawm zahpieh zaw lai diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in ama’ lungthahna in dan a pieh lo ziehin ama in khielna bawl ding pen a thupi ngaisut seng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Job kam kahin thu mawh gen a, a thei lopi-in thu tampi gen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu in a thugen zom a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tawmvei sung ei thuoh lai un, keima in note kang lah ding hi, azieh pen Pasien’ tangin gen ding kimkhat ka nei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamlapi panin ka theina kang keng ding a, thumanna pen kei ei Siempa-a’ ka hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ka thugente a khiel sih hi; nang tawh theina bukim nei pa a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“A tahtahin Pasien thahat a, koima simmaw lo hi; ama pen theitelna’ thakhauhna sungah thahat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in migilote a hinkhawi sih a, hinanle gimthuohte tungah dihtahin na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in mi thumante limtahin en a, hinanle kumpite, kumpi topha tungah kum tawn adingin tosah a, amahaw kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate kolah kibulin gentheina khau-a a awkhah uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amau’ kiphatsah gamtatnate ziehin ama in amate tungah a sepna ule a khielnate uh a pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in thuhilna ngai dingin a bil uh honpieh a, mawna pan a kilekia nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu ngai-in ama’ na a sep uleh, a nite uh hauna-in a mang ding vua, a kumte uh nopsahna-in a zang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle amate in a ngai sih uleh, namsau tawh a si ding vua, a theilona ziehun a sigam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Lungsim sunga Pasien nei lote in lungthahna a vom uhi; ama in amate a hen ciengin huna ngenin a kiko sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate khansi-in a hinna uh zumhuoi tahin a tawpsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a gentheina panun mi gentheite hunkhie a, hahsatna panin a bil uh a honpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in zong lungkhamna panin uhcipna om lo mun tanzau-ah nang ang zawl a, na sabuoi tunga an kiluite zong khu a tui a al vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hinanle migilote vai-ah nuom na sa a, thukhenna le thutang in nang ang mancip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thangpaina in simmawna-ah ang zawl lo nadingin kidawm inlen, guhgol sum tampi ziehin lam kipielsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na kikona le na thahatna zosie in na gentheina panin ang hu zo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ munah mite a kisuhmang hun ding, zan hun ang tun ding kal ngahla sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kidawm in! Sietna lamah kihei sin; tuami zieha gentheina tawh ang kize-et ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />En in, a vanglietna sungah Pasien kitawisang hi; ama tawh kibang sie koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pei nading lampi koi in lah a, ahi sihle, ‘Nang na khiel hi,’ koi in ci thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mite in la-a a phat uh ama’ nasepte nahpitaha na patawi ding lam phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi zosie in a nasepna mu zo uhi; a gamla panin mi zosie in a gal et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tahtahin Pasien lien a, ama i thei zo sih uhi; ama’ kumte kan zawh ding hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in tuimalte lato a, tuikhute khaihin guo-in a zusah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />vante in guotuite sungsuh a, mite tungah niengtahin zusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koi in meiite a kithezah dan le a inn-a awging thei zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />En in, ama in a kimkotah tun phesah a, tuipi thuh sung teng a khucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in tam teng tawh mite uh a, nehletah cingtahin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in a khut tawh kehtang tawi a, a dawina tah a kha dingin sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A awging in ama thu a gen a, khielna tungah lungthahna tawh ama a haza hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tami thu-ah ka lungtang kisai a, ka lung vana khai a bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai un, vanto tawh kibang ama’ awging le a kam pana pusuoh awging ngai vawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in vansin nei zosie-ah tunphe hla a, lei mong dong a tangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin ama’ aw ging a, a thupina awging tawh van thawnsahin, a awging a kizah ciengin tunphete khawlsah tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien in a aw tawh lamdang tahin van tosah a, ama in i thei zawh lo na lienpite a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in vua kungah, ‘Leitungah kiesuh in,’ ci hi; tuale a gih mama a guomal pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a piensah zosie in ama a thei nadingin mi zosie’ khutah lim khatin kizang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ganhingte a kuo sungah lut a, a kuo sung ciet vuah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitaw panin pumpei kihia a, leilu panin huivot a lang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ husan in tuikhal piengsah a, tui maitang tengah a khalkhalin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in meii sapi lahah tuikhu guong a, meiilumte in a tunphe a kithezahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tenna lei maitang tungah ama in a bawl ding vua a sawl zosie a kiman sieng nadingin ama’ puina bangin amate kihei kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in danpiehna ding ahi a, ahi sihle gam ading ahi a, ahi sihle itna lahna-in ahi zongin tuate a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Job aw, tam khu za in; khawl inlen Pasien’ na lamdang bawlte ngaisun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasien in amate tungah thu bangci pieh a, meii panin tunphe a taansah theina na thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kileh kimin meiilumte a zam theina, a bukim theina a nei Pasien’ bawl a na lamdangte na thei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitaw lam huipi ziehin leitung a vot ciengin, na puonsilte bang dinga lum thei ahei, ci na thei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Limlang banga a sah vantungte ama’ zeh bangin na zeh thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama kungah ka gen ding uh ei hil in; khuomiel ziehin ka thu uh ka gel thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka gen nuom thute ama kunga kigen phot ding amah? Mi khatpo in ama’ siet nadingin thu gen nuom ngai ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in vantungah khuovah a tan laitah, hui langin tuate a mut sieng ciengin, koima in khuovah a en thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leilu lam panin kham melpuo khuovah tang a, Pasien kimkotah a giinhuoi thupina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eite in Vanglienpa, i mu thei sih hi; ama vanglien mama-in zong thutang a, a lien mama a thumanna ziehin ama in mi gawt lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mite in ama a zatah vua, ama in a kipilsahte a thusim sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin pumpei lah panin Topa in Job dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Theina om lopi-in thu gen a, ka thuhilna a mielsah koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kipasalsah inlen na kawng gah in, thu kang dong ding a, nei dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Leitung bulpi ka phu lai-in nang hei-a om na hei? Theitelna na nei leh ei gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang cie phasah ding ci koi pen’ se ahei?-thei mama vateh! Ahi sihle a tunga tena khau hlungpa khu koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bang pen tungah a khuomte kiphut a, a ninga suong khu koi’ phum ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zingsol aasite in la a sahton cieng ule vantung mite zosie kipahin a awng uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahi sihle a kam panin tuipi a let ciengin, tuipi kotte koi in khah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meiilum puonin bawlin, khuomiel sapi naupuon-a ka bawl lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a gamgi ciemte-in kotpite le kotgolhte ka bawl lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Tam cieng pei-inlen a ban kal sin, na kiphatsahpi tuihuolte tana khawl ding hi ta, kang ci ngel sih amah?’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na pien ni-a kipanin zingmawng thu pie-in, phalvah zong ama’ mun ding theisahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaci’n leimong dong a salvah nading le tua panin migilote a thinmang nadingin nang in thu na pie ngai ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seal kitum tungman bangin leitung kikhel a, zatui tawh a kibum puon tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilote’ meivah kimitsah a, amau’ ban thahat kisattan pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipi sunga tuinah-ah lut kha ngai-in tuipi thuhpen nei-ah na pei ngai ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kungah sina tunkotte ang kilah ngai-in, miel thuhpi’ tunkotte na mu ngai ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leitung bangcie pha ci na thei ei mah? Ta teng zosie na thei leh hing pulah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khuovah a opna lampi hei sung hi a, khuomiel a opna mun hei sung ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n a gamgi dong na puoh thei ding a, a inn zotna lampite na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum hunin nang suoh zo na hi ziehin na kum tam lam zong thei mama vateh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Vua kikholna inn ah lut kha ngai-in, ahi sihle gieltang kholna inn na mu ngai ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate, lunggim hun le gal kido hun cieng dinga ka hen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuovah kizelna lampi bang hi a, leitungah suolam hui a kizelsuohna mun hei tah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Guotui luon nading hawhlam to a, keh kieh nading lampi sielpiehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />koima’ ten lona gam, mihing op lona senel tungah guo zusahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a tulsa gamkhingte a lungkim nadingin koi in lopa posah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Guotui in pa a nei amah?, daicimte koi’ piensah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koi’ naubu panin tuikhal pieng a, koi in vantunga vuakhalte piengsah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuite suong bangin sah a, tuipi thuh maitangte khalgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Vana Bawmluoite khiton thei-in, Zawlzawng kihenna khau na phel thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau’ hun zui-a a pei aasite pui thei-in, Ngambawm le a tate lampi na lah thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vantung nate’ thukipte na thei amah? Leitungah amahaw’ ngaina dante na bawl thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tuilet in ang hlup thei nadingin meiilom tungah na kiko to thei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tunphete na sawl thei nadingin na kungah hing pei-in, ‘Tanah om ung,’ ang ci ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Koi in pumpi sung lamah pilna koi a, koi in lungsim sungah theitelna pie ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Koi in meiite sim thei ahei? Ahi sihle leivuite a khalin kilomin leithemte a kimat ciengin, koi in vantunga tuibeemte buosuh thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Humpite sa matpieh thei-in, a kuo sung ahi sihle gamlahah sa a buh ciengun, nang in humpi a note na taisah zo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pasien tungah va-ah’ note kiko-in neh ding nei loin a len kawikawi ciengun, koi in amate an sih ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Muol tunga sakelte suo hun na thei amah? Sakhi a no nei hun na vil amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hla bangza sung gai uh ahei ci sim thei-in, a suo hun ding uh na thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A no suoh dingin lei-ah amate bawh a, a no nei lam uh na thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A note a thakhauh vua, gamlahah khanglien uhi; amate a pusuoh vua, a pite kungah a kilekia nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Gam-laate koi in hla ahei? A kikhina khau koi in sut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a inn ding uh gamgaw lah hisahin, a tenna uh citui gam hisah hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuopi gamlumna a nuisan zieu lel vua, sakol leeng hawipa’ kikona awging a za sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muoltangte tungah an a mai vua, hampa lohing zosie a sui kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Gam-bawngtang in nangma’ na a sem nuom amah? Zanlai-in na gankuong gei-ah a gieh ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tumakuoh ah khau tawh na khi thei amah? Ahi sihle na nua-a kuomte hlo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thahat ziehin ama tungah kingamin, ama tungah na nasep ap ding na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ancilna ah na ante hing puo-in ang kilekia dingin na um amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A hlakui-ah a mul om sih nanle va-kalaohte in a hla hazapin a zap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen a tuite lei lahah nuasie a, leitungah tuate a lumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keng khatpo in tuonkeh kha va ci a phawh sih a, gamsa khat in tuon kha va ci zong a phawh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama-a’ ahi lo bang danin a note a huot bawl a, a tui a thah ziehin gimnate a mawhna suoh nanle a thuse sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in pilna nei loin ama bawl a, tuale theitelna zong ama a kipie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a lengto dingin a hla a zah ciengin sakol le a tunga tuongpa a nuisan zieu lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Nang in sakol na hatsah amah? Nang in sakol’ ngawngmul na posah amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kauphe bangin na kitomsah amah? Ama’ nahsem ging pen zauhuoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A cin tawh nahpi-in lei khuotin, nasietahin lungdam kipah a, galte tawh kimu dingin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zauna kici nuisanin a lungkie sih a, namsau panin a kinuale sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama tunga om thalbawm khu kilawhin a ging a, teipi le teikhawte a te lihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in lungthahna le zauhuoina tawh lei valtum a, pengkul a kitum ciengin ama a omngim thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pengkul a gin ciengin, Haha! ci-in a ham hi. A gamla panin gal gimnam za a, galkap bute’ husa le awgingte kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Na pilna ziehin mupi sanglenin, leitaw lamah a hla a zap amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang thupiehna tawh muvanlai sanglenin, a sangpi-ah bu a tom amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Suongpi tungah ama teng a, suong kuohawm lahah bu a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum panin a sa mat dingte buh a, a gamlapi panin a mit in a galmu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A note in sisan a hup vua, gansi opna po-ah ama a om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale Topa in Job kungah gen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mawna mu thei pa in Vanglienpa kiselpi ding amah? Pasien tawh kiniel poma in ei thuhkia taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in Topa a dawng hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“En in, kei bangma ka hi sih hi; bangci dawn ding ka hei? Ka khutin ka kam ka hum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khatvei ka ham zo a, ka dawng sih ding hi; nivei ka gen zo a, ahi vangin ka genbe nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin pumpei lah panin Topa in Job dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kipasalsah inlen, na kawng gah in; thu kang dong ding a, nei gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang in kei nangawn ei khielsah ding na mah? Na dih thei nadingin kei ei mawsah ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien bangin ban nei-in, a awging tawh van na tosah thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Thupina le vangneina tawh kivon in; minthanna le pikuonna puon bangin sil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A letkhe na lungthahna teng bungsuh inlen, mi kiphasah zosie en inlen nuoicip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi kiphasah zosie en inlen khiesuh in. Migilote amau’ dinna munah tuoncil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amahaw zosie lei ah phuolton in; a maitangte uh leinei-ah khicip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin kei in zong na zietlam khut tawh ama guolzawna na pieh ka tahsang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nang bang lien-a ka bawl Behemoth en in; ama in bawngtang bangin lopa a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kawngah a hatna om a, a gil sagolh lahah a thahatna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mei, taamtah singzang bangin ka bawl a, a phei sagolhte a huolhuolin ka omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ gute sumngo lawng bang a, ama’ khut le kengte siazawl bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pasien’ nasep liente lahah a masa pen ahi a, ama a Bawlpa beh in namsau tawh ama neh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile muolsangte in a neh ding lopa posah a, gamsa zosie a ki-apmai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tui-unoh singkungte nei-ah ama lum a, nawng sunga pumpeng lahah kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hlim dingin tui-unoh singkungte in ama lie a, luidunga gielheh kungte in ama kimkot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gunte nangawn let nanle a zau sih a, Jordan gun a kam tan dong gei-in khang nanle lungmuongin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Koi in siakawi tawh man zo ding a, koi in thangsie-in a nah pheh zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngakuoi tawh Leviathan kai zo-in, khau tawh a lei na sawntum zo ngel ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nah sungah khau thun thei-in, siakawi tawh a khadang na vut pailet zo diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kungah tamveipi ang thum ding amah? Kamdam tawh ang hopi ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khantawna na sila-a lah dingin nang tawh thuciemna bawl ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vate bangin ama tawh ki-apmai-in, na sila numeite adingin khau na khi diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sumbawlte in a man deh ding uh amah? Sumbawlte lahah a hawm ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vunte siazum tawh na sun thei diei mah? Nga khawna teipi tawh a lu na khawlet zo diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tungah na khut va ngam ta’n; kidopi dingin ngaisun in; kipankia vawt sih vateh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama mat ding lametna khu lungkiehna ahi bep hi; a muna-ah pasien-te nangawn kizothaw hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama phin ngam ding za-in a hangsan koima a om sih hi. Ama mai-a a ding ngam ding koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama tawh kisi a, a suohta koi ahei? - Vansin nei zosie-ah a koi pen ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Keima in ama’ gute tawh kisai, a thahatnate le a duong kilawmnate gen loin ka om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koi in ama’ puonsil tungnung hawhpieh zo ahei? Koi in ama’ sia puonpi sun pailet zo ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A maitanga kotte koi in hong zo ahei? Ama’ ha kimkotah sil zauhuoi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’ elzang pen a kiguol ditdet lumte tawh kibawl a, seal kitum bangin a kicimat cihteh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khatlekhat a kimat ditdet ziehin a kikal vuah hui a pit sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate khatlekhat a kizom ditdet hi; tuate kimat dimdemin phel zawh ding hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in hatthi a law ciengin khuovah kikhaw a, zingmawng nisuo bangin a mitte a taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kam panin meikuongte ang pawtdawh a, meisite a leng vapual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mei kitaw pumpeng le tuibeel so bangin ama’ nah sung panin meikhu pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ husan in mei tawkuong a, ama’ kam panin meikuong pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ngawngah a hatna om a, ama’ mai-ah zauna a laam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tahsa kihlipte kimat suoh a, phen thei loin dettahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungtang suong bangin sah a, an gawina suong neipha bangin sah bihbeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thawto ciengin pasien-te a zau uhi; a ging a zah ciengun zau-in a nuakin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Namsau tawh a kisut vangin a bun zo sih a, teipi, thaltang, teikhaw tawh kisun nanle bun zo tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Siate butu bangin ngaisun a, sumngo zong sing muot bangin ngaisun zieu lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thal in ama taisah zo lo a, ama dingin suongsaili zong buvai tawh kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moltumte buvai bangin ngaisun a, teipi ging a nuisat vazuau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A neilang pen belpho keh tawh kibang a, buon tunga busatna om bangin kipha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuithuhte beel sunga tuiso bangsah a, tuipi zong sathau bung bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A peina nua lampite tangsah a; mite in tuithuh pen khu a samkangin a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leitungah a kikimpi koima a om sih a, giin kici a nei lo ganhing khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A kisangsah zosie kan kawikawi a, ama pen a kiliensah zosie tunga kumpi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Job in Topa dawng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangkim na bawl thei lam le na siltupte koima in a khaam thei lo lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Theina loin koi in tam thuhilna phuoldap ahei? Tua ziehin ka theitel lo thute, ka thei lo le kei dinga a lamdang mama thute ka gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Za in, kang gen ding hi; nang kang dong ding a, kei kungah nei gen ding hi,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thugente ka bilin ka na za ngai a, hinanle tu-in ka mit in ang mu ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin kei le kei ka kisimmaw a, leivui le vut kinu-in ka kisia ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in tam thu zosie Job kungah a gen zaw ciengin, Topa in Teman mi Eliphaz kungah: “Nang le na guol gel tungah ka lungthahna a kuong hi; azieh pen kei thu a manin na gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin tu-in bawngtang sagi le tuutang sagi kai-in ka nasempa Job kungah peipi unlen, noma dingin meihal biehna bawl un; tuale ka nasempa Job in note adingin ang thumpieh ding hi; azieh pen keima in note’ motna tawh kizui-in kang bawl sih ding hi; ama’ thungetna ka sang ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile note in Job’ gen bangin keima’ thu a manin na gen sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Teman mi Eliphaz le Shuh mi Bildad le Naamath mi Zophar pei-in Topa in amate kunga a gen bangin a gamta vua, tuale Topa in zong Job’ thungetna a sanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Job in a guol thum teng adingin thu a ngetpieh zaw ciengin Topa in Job citheisah kia hi; tuale Job tungah Topa in nidanga a neisa a zani-in a piekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah a sanggam numei pasal zosie le nidang lai-a a melthei teng zosie a haw vua, inn sungah ama tawh an a neton uhi; Topa in ama tunga a tunsah sil hoi lo zosie ziehin ama hlasietpi-in a henem uhi; tuale amate in sum pawlkhat le kham khutsip khat ciet a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in a masa lam sangin a hun nukhia lamah Job thupha piezaw a, ama in tuu tulsawm le tulli, kalaoh tulguh, bawngtang kap tulkhat, le laa api tulkhat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tapa sagi le tanu thum nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a tanu masa pen’ min Jemimah phuoh a, a nina pen Keziah hisahin a thumna nu’ min pen Keren-happuch phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gam sung zosie vuah Job’ tanute banga melhoi a om sih a, a sanggam pasalte tawh kibangin a pa un amate gamh a luosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Job kum za le kum sawmli sung hing lai a, khangli cieng dong a ta, a tute le a tusawnte mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Job a khan hlinin a vuoisi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
